  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">yohanalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <para style="toc2">yohanaH</para>
  <para style="toc3">yohanaH</para>
  <para style="mt1">yohanalikhitaH susaMvAdaH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Adau vAda AsIt sa cha vAda IshvareNa sArdhamAsIt sa vAdaH svayamIshvara eva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>sa AdAvIshvareNa sahAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tena sarvvaM vastu sasR^ije sarvveShu sR^iShTavastuShu kimapi vastu tenAsR^iShTaM nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>sa jIvanasyAkAraH, tachcha jIvanaM manuShyANAM jyotiH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tajjyotirandhakAre prachakAshe kintvandhakArastanna jagrAha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yohan nAmaka eko manuja IshvareNa preShayA nchakre|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadvArA yathA sarvve vishvasanti tadarthaM sa tajjyotiShi pramANaM dAtuM sAkShisvarUpo bhUtvAgamat,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>sa svayaM tajjyoti rna kintu tajjyotiShi pramANaM dAtumAgamat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>jagatyAgatya yaH sarvvamanujebhyo dIptiM dadAti tadeva satyajyotiH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>sa yajjagadasR^ijat tanmadya eva sa AsIt kintu jagato lokAstaM nAjAnan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>nijAdhikAraM sa AgachChat kintu prajAstaM nAgR^ihlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tathApi ye ye tamagR^ihlan arthAt tasya nAmni vyashvasan tebhya Ishvarasya putrA bhavitum adhikAram adadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>teShAM janiH shoNitAnna shArIrikAbhilAShAnna mAnavAnAmichChAto na kintvIshvarAdabhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>sa vAdo manuShyarUpeNAvatIryya satyatAnugrahAbhyAM paripUrNaH san sArdham asmAbhi rnyavasat tataH pituradvitIyaputrasya yogyo yo mahimA taM mahimAnaM tasyApashyAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tato yohanapi prachAryya sAkShyamidaM dattavAn yo mama pashchAd AgamiShyati sa matto gurutaraH; yato matpUrvvaM sa vidyamAna AsIt; yadartham ahaM sAkShyamidam adAM sa eShaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>apara ncha tasya pUrNatAyA vayaM sarvve kramashaH kramashonugrahaM prAptAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>mUsAdvArA vyavasthA dattA kintvanugrahaH satyatva ncha yIshukhrIShTadvArA samupAtiShThatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>kopi manuja IshvaraM kadApi nApashyat kintu pituH kroDastho.advitIyaH putrastaM prakAshayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tvaM kaH? iti vAkyaM preShTuM yadA yihUdIyalokA yAjakAn levilokAMshcha yirUshAlamo yohanaH samIpe preShayAmAsuH,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA sa svIkR^itavAn nApahnUtavAn nAham abhiShikta itya NgIkR^itavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan tarhi ko bhavAn? kiM eliyaH? sovadat na; tataste.apR^ichChan tarhi bhavAn sa bhaviShyadvAdI? sovadat nAhaM saH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan tarhi bhavAn kaH? vayaM gatvA prerakAn tvayi kiM vakShyAmaH? svasmin kiM vadasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA sovadat| parameshasya panthAnaM pariShkuruta sarvvataH| itIdaM prAntare vAkyaM vadataH kasyachidravaH| kathAmimAM yasmin yishayiyo bhaviShyadvAdI likhitavAn soham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ye preShitAste phirUshilokAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan yadi nAbhiShiktosi eliyosi na sa bhaviShyadvAdyapi nAsi cha, tarhi lokAn majjayasi kutaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yohan pratyavochat, toye.ahaM majjayAmIti satyaM kintu yaM yUyaM na jAnItha tAdR^isha eko jano yuShmAkaM madhya upatiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sa matpashchAd Agatopi matpUrvvaM varttamAna AsIt tasya pAdukAbandhanaM mochayitumapi nAhaM yogyosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>yarddananadyAH pArasthabaithabArAyAM yasminsthAne yohanamajjayat tasmina sthAne sarvvametad aghaTata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>pare.ahani yohan svanikaTamAgachChantaM yishuM vilokya prAvochat jagataH pApamochakam Ishvarasya meShashAvakaM pashyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yo mama pashchAdAgamiShyati sa matto gurutaraH, yato hetormatpUrvvaM so.avarttata yasminnahaM kathAmimAM kathitavAn sa evAyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>aparaM nAhamenaM pratyabhij nAtavAn kintu isrAyellokA enaM yathA parichinvanti tadabhiprAyeNAhaM jale majjayitumAgachCham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>punashcha yohanaparamekaM pramANaM datvA kathitavAn vihAyasaH kapotavad avatarantamAtmAnam asyoparyyavatiShThantaM cha dR^iShTavAnaham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>nAhamenaM pratyabhij nAtavAn iti satyaM kintu yo jale majjayituM mAM prairayat sa evemAM kathAmakathayat yasyoparyyAtmAnam avatarantam avatiShThanta ncha drakShayasi saeva pavitre Atmani majjayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>avastannirIkShyAyam Ishvarasya tanaya iti pramANaM dadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pare.ahani yohan dvAbhyAM shiShyAbhyAM sArddheM tiShThan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yishuM gachChantaM vilokya gaditavAn, Ishvarasya meShashAvakaM pashyataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>imAM kathAM shrutvA dvau shiShyau yIshoH pashchAd IyatuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIshuH parAvR^itya tau pashchAd AgachChantau dR^iShTvA pR^iShTavAn yuvAM kiM gaveshayathaH? tAvapR^ichChatAM he rabbi arthAt he guro bhavAn kutra tiShThati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tataH sovAdit etya pashyataM| tato divasasya tR^itIyapraharasya gatatvAt tau taddinaM tasya sa Nge.asthAtAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yau dvau yohano vAkyaM shrutvA yishoH pashchAd AgamatAM tayoH shimonpitarasya bhrAtA AndriyaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>sa itvA prathamaM nijasodaraM shimonaM sAkShAtprApya kathitavAn vayaM khrIShTam arthAt abhiShiktapuruShaM sAkShAtkR^itavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>pashchAt sa taM yishoH samIpam Anayat| tadA yIshustaM dR^iShTvAvadat tvaM yUnasaH putraH shimon kintu tvannAmadheyaM kaiphAH vA pitaraH arthAt prastaro bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>pare.ahani yIshau gAlIlaM gantuM nishchitachetasi sati philipanAmAnaM janaM sAkShAtprApyAvochat mama pashchAd AgachCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>baitsaidAnAmni yasmin grAme pitarAndriyayorvAsa AsIt tasmin grAme tasya philipasya vasatirAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>pashchAt philipo nithanelaM sAkShAtprApyAvadat mUsA vyavasthA granthe bhaviShyadvAdinAM grantheShu cha yasyAkhyAnaM likhitamAste taM yUShaphaH putraM nAsaratIyaM yIshuM sAkShAd akArShma vayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA nithanel kathitavAn nAsarannagarAta kiM kashchiduttama utpantuM shaknoti? tataH philipo .avochat etya pashya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>apara ncha yIshuH svasya samIpaM tam AgachChantaM dR^iShTvA vyAhR^itavAn, pashyAyaM niShkapaTaH satya isrAyellokaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tataH sovadad, bhavAn mAM kathaM pratyabhijAnAti? yIshuravAdIt philipasya AhvAnAt pUrvvaM yadA tvamuDumbarasya tarormUle.asthAstadA tvAmadarsham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>nithanel achakathat, he guro bhavAn nitAntam Ishvarasya putrosi, bhavAn isrAyelvaMshasya rAjA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tato yIshu rvyAharat, tvAmuDumbarasya pAdapasya mUle dR^iShTavAnAhaM mamaitasmAdvAkyAt kiM tvaM vyashvasIH? etasmAdapyAshcharyyANi kAryyANi drakShyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>anyachchAvAdId yuShmAnahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, itaH paraM mochite meghadvAre tasmAnmanujasUnunA Ishvarasya dUtagaNam avarohantamArohanta ncha drakShyatha|</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM trutIyadivase gAlIl pradeshiye kAnnAnAmni nagare vivAha AsIt tatra cha yIshormAtA tiShThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tasmai vivAhAya yIshustasya shiShyAshcha nimantritA Asan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadanantaraM drAkShArasasya nyUnatvAd yIshormAtA tamavadat eteShAM drAkShAraso nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA sa tAmavochat he nAri mayA saha tava kiM kAryyaM? mama samaya idAnIM nopatiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tatastasya mAtA dAsAnavochad ayaM yad vadati tadeva kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tasmin sthAne yihUdIyAnAM shuchitvakaraNavyavahArAnusAreNADhakaikajaladharANi pAShANamayAni ShaDvR^ihatpAtrANiAsan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAn sarvvakalashAn jalaiH pUrayituM tAnAj nApayat, tataste sarvvAn kumbhAnAkarNaM jalaiH paryyapUrayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>atha tebhyaH ki nchiduttAryya bhojyAdhipAteHsamIpaM netuM sa tAnAdishat, te tadanayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>apara ncha tajjalaM kathaM drAkShAraso.abhavat tajjalavAhakAdAsA j nAtuM shaktAH kintu tadbhojyAdhipo j nAtuM nAshaknot tadavalihya varaM saMmbodyAvadata,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>lokAH prathamaM uttamadrAkShArasaM dadati taShu yatheShTaM pitavatsu tasmA ki nchidanuttama ncha dadati kintu tvamidAnIM yAvat uttamadrAkShArasaM sthApayasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>itthaM yIshurgAlIlapradeshe AshcharyyakArmma prArambha nijamahimAnaM prAkAshayat tataH shiShyAstasmin vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tataH param sa nijamAtrubhrAtrusshiShyaiH sArddhM kapharnAhUmam Agamat kintu tatra bahUdinAni AtiShThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yihUdiyAnAM nistArotsave nikaTamAgate yIshu ryirUshAlam nagaram AgachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tato mandirasya madhye gomeShapArAvatavikrayiNo vANijakShchopaviShTAn vilokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>rajjubhiH kashAM nirmmAya sarvvagomeShAdibhiH sArddhaM tAn mandirAd dUrIkR^itavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>vaNijAM mudrAdi vikIryya AsanAni nyUbjIkR^itya pArAvatavikrayibhyo.akathayad asmAt sthAnAt sarvANyetAni nayata, mama pitugR^ihaM vANijyagR^ihaM mA kArShTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tasmAt tanmandirArtha udyogo yastu sa grasatIva mAm| imAM shAstrIyalipiM shiShyAHsamasmaran|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH param yihUdIyalokA yIShimavadan tavamidR^ishakarmmakaraNAt kiM chihnamasmAn darshayasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tato yIshustAnavochad yuShmAbhire tasmin mandire nAshite dinatrayamadhye.ahaM tad utthApayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA yihUdiyA vyAhArShuH, etasya mandirasa nirmmANena ShaTchatvAriMshad vatsarA gatAH, tvaM kiM dinatrayamadhye tad utthApayiShyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu sa nijadeharUpamandire kathAmimAM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sa yadetAdR^ishaM gaditavAn tachChiShyAH shmashAnAt tadIyotthAne sati smR^itvA dharmmagranthe yIshunoktakathAyAM cha vyashvasiShuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>anantaraM nistArotsavasya bhojyasamaye yirUshAlam nagare tatkrutAshcharyyakarmmANi vilokya bahubhistasya nAmani vishvasitaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>kintu sa teShAM kareShu svaM na samarpayat, yataH sa sarvvAnavait|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>sa mAnaveShu kasyachit pramANaM nApekShata yato manujAnAM madhye yadyadasti tattat sojAnAt|</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nikadimanAmA yihUdIyAnAm adhipatiH phirUshI kShaNadAyAM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yIshaurabhyarNam Avrajya vyAhArShIt, he guro bhavAn IshvarAd Agat eka upadeShTA, etad asmAbhirj nAyate; yato bhavatA yAnyAshcharyyakarmmANi kriyante parameshvarasya sAhAyyaM vinA kenApi tattatkarmmANi karttuM na shakyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA yIshuruttaraM dattavAn tavAhaM yathArthataraM vyAharAmi punarjanmani na sati kopi mAnava Ishvarasya rAjyaM draShTuM na shaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tato nikadImaH pratyavochat manujo vR^iddho bhUtvA kathaM janiShyate? sa kiM puna rmAtR^irjaTharaM pravishya janituM shaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIshuravAdId yathArthataram ahaM kathayAmi manuje toyAtmabhyAM puna rna jAte sa Ishvarasya rAjyaM praveShTuM na shaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>mAMsAd yat jAyate tan mAMsameva tathAtmano yo jAyate sa Atmaiva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yuShmAbhiH puna rjanitavyaM mamaitasyAM kathAyAm AshcharyaM mA maMsthAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>sadAgatiryAM dishamichChati tasyAmeva dishi vAti, tvaM tasya svanaM shuNoShi kintu sa kuta AyAti kutra yAti vA kimapi na jAnAsi tadvAd AtmanaH sakAshAt sarvveShAM manujAnAM janma bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA nikadImaH pR^iShTavAn etat kathaM bhavituM shaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyaktavAn tvamisrAyelo gururbhUtvApi kimetAM kathAM na vetsi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tubhyaM yathArthaM kathayAmi, vayaM yad vidmastad vachmaH yaMchcha pashyAmastasyaiva sAkShyaM dadmaH kintu yuShmAbhirasmAkaM sAkShitvaM na gR^ihyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>etasya saMsArasya kathAyAM kathitAyAM yadi yUyaM na vishvasitha tarhi svargIyAyAM kathAyAM kathaM vishvasiShyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yaH svarge.asti yaM cha svargAd avArohat taM mAnavatanayaM vinA kopi svargaM nArohat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>apara ncha mUsA yathA prAntare sarpaM protthApitavAn manuShyaputro.api tathaivotthApitavyaH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tasmAd yaH kashchit tasmin vishvasiShyati so.avinAshyaH san anantAyuH prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ishvara itthaM jagadadayata yat svamadvitIyaM tanayaM prAdadAt tato yaH kashchit tasmin vishvasiShyati so.avinAshyaH san anantAyuH prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ishvaro jagato lokAn daNDayituM svaputraM na preShya tAn paritrAtuM preShitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ataeva yaH kashchit tasmin vishvasiti sa daNDArho na bhavati kintu yaH kashchit tasmin na vishvasiti sa idAnImeva daNDArho bhavati,yataH sa IshvarasyAdvitIyaputrasya nAmani pratyayaM na karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>jagato madhye jyotiH prAkAshata kintu manuShyANAM karmmaNAM dR^iShTatvAt te jyotiShopi timire prIyante etadeva daNDasya kAraNAM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yaH kukarmma karoti tasyAchArasya dR^iShTatvAt sa jyotirR^ItIyitvA tannikaTaM nAyAti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu yaH satkarmma karoti tasya sarvvANi karmmANIshvareNa kR^itAnIti sathA prakAshate tadabhiprAyeNa sa jyotiShaH sannidhim AyAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH param yIshuH shiShyaiH sArddhaM yihUdIyadeshaM gatvA tatra sthitvA majjayitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA shAlam nagarasya samIpasthAyini ainan grAme bahutaratoyasthitestatra yohan amajjayat tathA cha lokA Agatya tena majjitA abhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tadA yohan kArAyAM na baddhaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>apara ncha shAchakarmmaNi yohAnaH shiShyaiH saha yihUdIyalokAnAM vivAde jAte, te yohanaH saMnnidhiM gatvAkathayan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>he guro yarddananadyAH pAre bhavatA sArddhaM ya AsIt yasmiMshcha bhavAn sAkShyaM pradadAt pashyatu sopi majjayati sarvve tasya samIpaM yAnti cha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tadA yohan pratyavochad IshvareNa na datte kopi manujaH kimapi prAptuM na shaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM abhiShikto na bhavAmi kintu tadagre preShitosmi yAmimAM kathAM kathitavAnAhaM tatra yUyaM sarvve sAkShiNaH stha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yo janaH kanyAM labhate sa eva varaH kintu varasya sannidhau daNDAyamAnaM tasya yanmitraM tena varasya shabde shrute.atIvAhlAdyate mamApi tadvad AnandasiddhirjAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tena kramasho varddhitavyaM kintu mayA hsitavyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ya UrdhvAdAgachChat sa sarvveShAM mukhyo yashcha saMsArAd udapadyata sa sAMsArikaH saMsArIyAM kathA ncha kathayati yastu svargAdAgachChat sa sarvveShAM mukhyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>sa yadapashyadashR^iNochcha tasminneva sAkShyaM dadAti tathApi prAyashaH kashchit tasya sAkShyaM na gR^ihlAti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kintu yo gR^ihlAti sa Ishvarasya satyavAditvaM mudrA NgitaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>IshvareNa yaH preritaH saeva IshvarIyakathAM kathayati yata Ishvara AtmAnaM tasmai aparimitam adadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pitA putre snehaM kR^itvA tasya haste sarvvANi samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yaH kashchit putre vishvasiti sa evAnantam paramAyuH prApnoti kintu yaH kashchit putre na vishvasiti sa paramAyuSho darshanaM na prApnoti kintvIshvarasya kopabhAjanaM bhUtvA tiShThati|</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>yIshuH svayaM nAmajjayat kevalaM tasya shiShyA amajjayat kintu yohano.adhikashiShyAn sa karoti majjayati cha,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>phirUshina imAM vArttAmashR^iNvan iti prabhuravagatya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yihUdIyadeshaM vihAya puna rgAlIlam Agat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tataH shomiroNapradeshasya madyena tena gantavye sati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yAkUb nijaputrAya yUShaphe yAM bhUmim adadAt tatsamIpasthAyi shomiroNapradeshasya sukhAr nAmnA vikhyAtasya nagarasya sannidhAvupAsthAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tatra yAkUbaH prahirAsIt; tadA dvitIyayAmavelAyAM jAtAyAM sa mArge shramApannastasya praheH pArshve upAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>etarhi kAchit shomiroNIyA yoShit toyottolanArtham tatrAgamat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA shiShyAH khAdyadravyANi kretuM nagaram agachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yIshuH shomiroNIyAM tAM yoShitam vyAhArShIt mahyaM ki nchit pAnIyaM pAtuM dehi| kintu shomiroNIyaiH sAkaM yihUdIyalokA na vyavAharan tasmAddhetoH sAkathayat shomiroNIyA yoShitadahaM tvaM yihUdIyosi kathaM mattaH pAnIyaM pAtum ichChasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIshuravadad Ishvarasya yaddAnaM tatkIdR^ik pAnIyaM pAtuM mahyaM dehi ya itthaM tvAM yAchate sa vA ka iti chedaj nAsyathAstarhi tamayAchiShyathAH sa cha tubhyamamR^itaM toyamadAsyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadA sA sImantinI bhAShitavati, he mahechCha prahirgambhIro bhavato nIrottolanapAtraM nAstI cha tasmAt tadamR^itaM kIlAlaM kutaH prApsyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yosmabhyam imamandhUM dadau, yasya cha parijanA gomeShAdayashcha sarvve.asya praheH pAnIyaM papuretAdR^isho yosmAkaM pUrvvapuruSho yAkUb tasmAdapi bhavAn mahAn kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tato yIshurakathayad idaM pAnIyaM saH pivati sa punastR^iShArtto bhaviShyati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>kintu mayA dattaM pAnIyaM yaH pivati sa punaH kadApi tR^iShArtto na bhaviShyati| mayA dattam idaM toyaM tasyAntaH prasravaNarUpaM bhUtvA anantAyuryAvat sroShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA sA vanitAkathayat he mahechCha tarhi mama punaH pIpAsA yathA na jAyate toyottolanAya yathAtrAgamanaM na bhavati cha tadarthaM mahyaM tattoyaM dehI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato yIshUravadadyAhi tava patimAhUya sthAne.atrAgachCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>sA vAmAvadat mama patirnAsti| yIshuravadat mama patirnAstIti vAkyaM bhadramavochaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yatastava pa ncha patayobhavan adhunA tu tvayA sArddhaM yastiShThati sa tava bharttA na vAkyamidaM satyamavAdiH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA sA mahilA gaditavati he mahechCha bhavAn eko bhaviShyadvAdIti buddhaM mayA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>asmAkaM pitR^ilokA etasmin shilochchaye.abhajanta, kintu bhavadbhiruchyate yirUshAlam nagare bhajanayogyaM sthAnamAste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yIshuravochat he yoShit mama vAkye vishvasihi yadA yUyaM kevalashaile.asmin vA yirUshAlam nagare piturbhajanaM na kariShyadhve kAla etAdR^isha AyAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yUyaM yaM bhajadhve taM na jAnItha, kintu vayaM yaM bhajAmahe taM jAnImahe, yato yihUdIyalokAnAM madhyAt paritrANaM jAyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>kintu yadA satyabhaktA AtmanA satyarUpeNa cha piturbhajanaM kariShyante samaya etAdR^isha AyAti, varam idAnImapi vidyate ; yata etAdR^isho bhatkAn pitA cheShTate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ishvara AtmA; tatastasya ye bhaktAstaiH sa AtmanA satyarUpeNa cha bhajanIyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sA mahilAvAdIt khrIShTanAmnA vikhyAto.abhiShiktaH puruSha AgamiShyatIti jAnAmi sa cha sarvvAH kathA asmAn j nApayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIshuravadat tvayA sArddhaM kathanaM karomi yo.aham ahameva sa puruShaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>etasmin samaye shiShyA Agatya tathA striyA sArddhaM tasya kathopakathane mahAshcharyyam amanyanta tathApi bhavAn kimichChati? yadvA kimartham etayA sArddhaM kathAM kathayati? iti kopi nApR^ichChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tataH paraM sA nArI kalashaM sthApayitvA nagaramadhyaM gatvA lokebhyokathAyad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>ahaM yadyat karmmAkaravaM tatsarvvaM mahyamakathayad etAdR^ishaM mAnavamekam Agatya pashyata ru kim abhiShikto na bhavati ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tataste nagarAd bahirAgatya tAtasya samIpam Ayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>etarhi shiShyAH sAdhayitvA taM vyAhArShuH he guro bhavAn ki nchid bhUktAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tataH sovadad yuShmAbhiryanna j nAyate tAdR^ishaM bhakShyaM mamAste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadA shiShyAH parasparaM praShTum Arambhanta, kimasmai kopi kimapi bhakShyamAnIya dattavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yIshuravochat matprerakasyAbhimatAnurUpakaraNaM tasyaiva karmmasiddhikAraNa ncha mama bhakShyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>mAsachatuShTaye jAte shasyakarttanasamayo bhaviShyatIti vAkyaM yuShmAbhiH kiM nodyate? kintvahaM vadAmi, shira uttolya kShetrANi prati nirIkShya pashyata, idAnIM karttanayogyAni shuklavarNAnyabhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yashChinatti sa vetanaM labhate anantAyuHsvarUpaM shasyaM sa gR^ihlAti cha, tenaiva vaptA ChettA cha yugapad AnandataH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>itthaM sati vapatyekashChinatyanya iti vachanaM siddhyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>yatra yUyaM na paryyashrAmyata tAdR^ishaM shasyaM ChettuM yuShmAn prairayam anye janAHparyyashrAmyan yUyaM teShAM shragasya phalam alabhadhvam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>yasmin kAle yadyat karmmAkArShaM tatsarvvaM sa mahyam akathayat tasyA vanitAyA idaM sAkShyavAkyaM shrutvA tannagaranivAsino bahavaH shomiroNIyalokA vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tathA cha tasyAntike samupasthAya sveShAM sannidhau katichid dinAni sthAtuM tasmin vinayam akurvvAna tasmAt sa dinadvayaM tatsthAne nyavaShTat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tatastasyopadeshena bahavo.apare vishvasya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tAM yoShAmavadan kevalaM tava vAkyena pratIma iti na, kintu sa jagato.abhiShiktastrAteti tasya kathAM shrutvA vayaM svayamevAj nAsamahi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>svadeshe bhaviShyadvaktuH satkAro nAstIti yadyapi yIshuH pramANaM datvAkathayat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tathApi divasadvayAt paraM sa tasmAt sthAnAd gAlIlaM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>anantaraM ye gAlIlI liyalokA utsave gatA utsavasamaye yirUshalam nagare tasya sarvvAH kriyA apashyan te gAlIlam AgataM tam AgR^ihlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tataH param yIshu ryasmin kAnnAnagare jalaM drAkShArasam Akarot tat sthAnaM punaragAt| tasminneva samaye kasyachid rAjasabhAstArasya putraH kapharnAhUmapurI rogagrasta AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>sa yehUdIyadeshAd yIsho rgAlIlAgamanavArttAM nishamya tasya samIpaM gatvA prArthya vyAhR^itavAn mama putrasya prAyeNa kAla AsannaH bhavAn Agatya taM svasthaM karotu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tadA yIshurakathayad AshcharyyaM karmma chitraM chihnaM cha na dR^iShTA yUyaM na pratyeShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tataH sa sabhAsadavadat he mahechCha mama putre na mR^ite bhavAnAgachChatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>yIshustamavadad gachCha tava putro.ajIvIt tadA yIshunoktavAkye sa vishvasya gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>gamanakAle mArgamadhye dAsAstaM sAkShAtprApyAvadan bhavataH putro.ajIvIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tataH kaM kAlamArabhya rogapratIkArArambho jAtA iti pR^iShTe tairuktaM hyaH sArddhadaNDadvayAdhikadvitIyayAme tasya jvaratyAgo.abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tadA yIshustasmin kShaNe proktavAn tava putro.ajIvIt pitA tadbuddhvA saparivAro vyashvasIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yihUdIyadeshAd Agatya gAlIli yIshuretad dvitIyam AshcharyyakarmmAkarot|</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yihUdIyAnAm utsava upasthite yIshu ryirUshAlamaM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tasminnagare meShanAmno dvArasya samIpe ibrIyabhAShayA baithesdA nAmnA piShkariNI pa nchaghaTTayuktAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tasyAsteShu ghaTTeShu kilAlakampanam apekShya andhakha nchashuShkA NgAdayo bahavo rogiNaH patantastiShThanti sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yato visheShakAle tasya saraso vAri svargIyadUta etyAkampayat tatkIlAlakampanAt paraM yaH kashchid rogI prathamaM pAnIyamavArohat sa eva tatkShaNAd rogamukto.abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadAShTAtriMshadvarShANi yAvad rogagrasta ekajanastasmin sthAne sthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIshustaM shayitaM dR^iShTvA bahukAlikarogIti j nAtvA vyAhR^itavAn tvaM kiM svastho bubhUShasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tato rogI kathitavAn he mahechCha yadA kIlAlaM kampate tadA mAM puShkariNIm avarohayituM mama kopi nAsti, tasmAn mama gamanakAle kashchidanyo.agro gatvA avarohati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA yIshurakathayad uttiShTha, tava shayyAmuttolya gR^ihItvA yAhi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>sa tatkShaNAt svastho bhUtvA shayyAmuttolyAdAya gatavAn kintu taddinaM vishrAmavAraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAH svasthaM naraM vyAharan adya vishrAmavAre shayanIyamAdAya na yAtavyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyavochad yo mAM svastham akArShIt shayanIyam uttolyAdAya yAtuM mAM sa evAdishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan shayanIyam uttolyAdAya yAtuM ya Aj nApayat sa kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu sa ka iti svasthIbhUto nAjAnAd yatastasmin sthAne janatAsattvAd yIshuH sthAnAntaram Agamat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH paraM yeshu rmandire taM naraM sAkShAtprApyAkathayat pashyedAnIm anAmayo jAtosi yathAdhikA durdashA na ghaTate taddhetoH pApaM karmma punarmAkArShIH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tataH sa gatvA yihUdIyAn avadad yIshu rmAm arogiNam akArShIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato yIshu rvishrAmavAre karmmedR^ishaM kR^itavAn iti heto ryihUdIyAstaM tADayitvA hantum acheShTanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yIshustAnAkhyat mama pitA yat kAryyaM karoti tadanurUpam ahamapi karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyAstaM hantuM punarayatanta yato vishrAmavAraM nAmanyata tadeva kevalaM na adhikantu IshvaraM svapitaraM prochya svamapIshvaratulyaM kR^itavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>pashchAd yIshuravadad yuShmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi putraH pitaraM yadyat karmma kurvvantaM pashyati tadatiriktaM svechChAtaH kimapi karmma karttuM na shaknoti| pitA yat karoti putropi tadeva karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>pitA putre snehaM karoti tasmAt svayaM yadyat karmma karoti tatsarvvaM putraM darshayati ; yathA cha yuShmAkaM Ashcharyyaj nAnaM janiShyate tadartham itopi mahAkarmma taM darshayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>vastutastu pitA yathA pramitAn utthApya sajivAn karoti tadvat putropi yaM yaM ichChati taM taM sajIvaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sarvve pitaraM yathA satkurvvanti tathA putramapi satkArayituM pitA svayaM kasyApi vichAramakR^itvA sarvvavichArANAM bhAraM putre samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yaH putraM sat karoti sa tasya prerakamapi sat karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yuShmAnAhaM yathArthataraM vadAmi yo jano mama vAkyaM shrutvA matprerake vishvasiti sonantAyuH prApnoti kadApi daNDabAjanaM na bhavati nidhanAdutthAya paramAyuH prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi yadA mR^itA Ishvaraputrasya ninAdaM shroShyanti ye cha shroShyanti te sajIvA bhaviShyanti samaya etAdR^isha AyAti varam idAnImapyupatiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>pitA yathA svaya njIvI tathA putrAya svaya njIvitvAdhikAraM dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sa manuShyaputraH etasmAt kAraNAt pitA daNDakaraNAdhikAramapi tasmin samarpitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>etadarthe yUyam AshcharyyaM na manyadhvaM yato yasmin samaye tasya ninAdaM shrutvA shmashAnasthAH sarvve bahirAgamiShyanti samaya etAdR^isha upasthAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tasmAd ye satkarmmANi kR^itavantasta utthAya AyuH prApsyanti ye cha kukarmANi kR^itavantasta utthAya daNDaM prApsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>ahaM svayaM kimapi karttuM na shaknomi yathA shuNomi tathA vichArayAmi mama vichAra ncha nyAyyaH yatohaM svIyAbhIShTaM nehitvA matprerayituH pituriShTam Ihe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>yadi svasmin svayaM sAkShyaM dadAmi tarhi tatsAkShyam AgrAhyaM bhavati ;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kintu madarthe.aparo janaH sAkShyaM dadAti madarthe tasya yat sAkShyaM tat satyam etadapyahaM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yuShmAbhi ryohanaM prati lokeShu preriteShu sa satyakathAyAM sAkShyamadadAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>mAnuShAdahaM sAkShyaM nopekShe tathApi yUyaM yathA paritrayadhve tadartham idaM vAkyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yohan dedIpyamAno dIpa iva tejasvI sthitavAn yUyam alpakAlaM tasya dIptyAnandituM samamanyadhvaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>kintu tatpramANAdapi mama gurutaraM pramANaM vidyate pitA mAM preShya yadyat karmma samApayituM shakttimadadAt mayA kR^itaM tattat karmma madarthe pramANaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yaH pitA mAM preritavAn mopi madarthe pramANaM dadAti| tasya vAkyaM yuShmAbhiH kadApi na shrutaM tasya rUpa ncha na dR^iShTaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tasya vAkya ncha yuShmAkam antaH kadApi sthAnaM nApnoti yataH sa yaM preShitavAn yUyaM tasmin na vishvasitha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>dharmmapustakAni yUyam AlochayadhvaM tai rvAkyairanantAyuH prApsyAma iti yUyaM budhyadhve taddharmmapustakAni madarthe pramANaM dadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tathApi yUyaM paramAyuHprAptaye mama saMnidhim na jigamiShatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>ahaM mAnuShebhyaH satkAraM na gR^ihlAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAn jAnAmi; yuShmAkamantara Ishvaraprema nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>ahaM nijapitu rnAmnAgatosmi tathApi mAM na gR^ihlItha kintu kashchid yadi svanAmnA samAgamiShyati tarhi taM grahIShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yUyam IshvarAt satkAraM na chiShTatvA kevalaM parasparaM satkAram ched Adadhvve tarhi kathaM vishvasituM shaknutha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>putuH samIpe.ahaM yuShmAn apavadiShyAmIti mA chintayata yasmin , yasmin yuShmAkaM vishvasaH saeva mUsA yuShmAn apavadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM tasmin vyashvasiShyata tarhi mayyapi vyashvasiShyata, yat sa mayi likhitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tato yadi tena likhitavAni na pratitha tarhi mama vAkyAni kathaM pratyeShyatha?</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshu rgAlIl pradeshIyasya tiviriyAnAmnaH sindhoH pAraM gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tato vyAdhimallokasvAsthyakaraNarUpANi tasyAshcharyyANi karmmANi dR^iShTvA bahavo janAstatpashchAd agachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tato yIshuH parvvatamAruhya tatra shiShyaiH sAkam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tasmin samaya nistArotsavanAmni yihUdIyAnAma utsava upasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIshu rnetre uttolya bahulokAn svasamIpAgatAn vilokya philipaM pR^iShTavAn eteShAM bhojanAya bhojadravyANi vayaM kutra kretuM shakrumaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>vAkyamidaM tasya parIkShArtham avAdIt kintu yat kariShyati tat svayam ajAnAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>philipaH pratyavochat eteShAm ekaiko yadyalpam alpaM prApnoti tarhi mudrApAdadvishatena krItapUpA api nyUnA bhaviShyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>shimon pitarasya bhrAtA AndriyAkhyaH shiShyANAmeko vyAhR^itavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>atra kasyachid bAlakasya samIpe pa ncha yAvapUpAH kShudramatsyadvaya ncha santi kintu lokAnAM etAvAtAM madhye taiH kiM bhaviShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>pashchAd yIshuravadat lokAnupaveshayata tatra bahuyavasasattvAt pa nchasahastrebhyo nyUnA adhikA vA puruShA bhUmyAm upAvishan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tato yIshustAn pUpAnAdAya Ishvarasya guNAn kIrttayitvA shiShyeShu samArpayat tataste tebhya upaviShTalokebhyaH pUpAn yatheShTamatsya ncha prAduH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>teShu tR^ipteShu sa tAnavochad eteShAM ki nchidapi yathA nApachIyate tathA sarvvANyavashiShTAni saMgR^ihlIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tataH sarvveShAM bhojanAt paraM te teShAM pa nchAnAM yAvapUpAnAM avashiShTAnyakhilAni saMgR^ihya dvAdashaDallakAn apUrayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>aparaM yIshoretAdR^ishIm AshcharyyakriyAM dR^iShTvA lokA mitho vaktumArebhire jagati yasyAgamanaM bhaviShyati sa evAyam avashyaM bhaviShyadvakttA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>ataeva lokA Agatya tamAkramya rAjAnaM kariShyanti yIshusteShAm IdR^ishaM mAnasaM vij nAya punashcha parvvatam ekAkI gatavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>sAyaMkAla upasthite shiShyA jaladhitaTaM vrajitvA nAvamAruhya nagaradishi sindhau vAhayitvAgaman|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tasmin samaye timira upAtiShThat kintu yIShusteShAM samIpaM nAgachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tadA prabalapavanavahanAt sAgare mahAtara Ngo bhavitum Arebhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataste vAhayitvA dvitrAn kroshAn gatAH pashchAd yIshuM jaladherupari padbhyAM vrajantaM naukAntikam AgachChantaM vilokya trAsayuktA abhavan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>kintu sa tAnukttavAn ayamahaM mA bhaiShTa|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA te taM svairaM nAvi gR^ihItavantaH tadA tatkShaNAd uddiShTasthAne naurupAsthAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yayA nAvA shiShyA agachChan tadanyA kApi naukA tasmin sthAne nAsIt tato yIshuH shiShyaiH sAkaM nAgamat kevalAH shiShyA agaman etat pArasthA lokA j nAtavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>kintu tataH paraM prabhu ryatra Ishvarasya guNAn anukIrttya lokAn pUpAn abhojayat tatsthAnasya samIpasthativiriyAyA aparAstaraNaya Agaman|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yIshustatra nAsti shiShyA api tatra nA santi lokA iti vij nAya yIshuM gaveShayituM taraNibhiH kapharnAhUm puraM gatAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tataste saritpateH pAre taM sAkShAt prApya prAvochan he guro bhavAn atra sthAne kadAgamat?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAn pratyavAdId yuShmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi AshcharyyakarmmadarshanAddheto rna kintu pUpabhojanAt tena tR^iptatvA ncha mAM gaveShayatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kShayaNIyabhakShyArthaM mA shrAmiShTa kintvantAyurbhakShyArthaM shrAmyata, tasmAt tAdR^ishaM bhakShyaM manujaputro yuShmAbhyaM dAsyati; tasmin tAta IshvaraH pramANaM prAdAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan IshvarAbhimataM karmma karttum asmAbhiH kiM karttavyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tato yIshuravadad Ishvaro yaM prairayat tasmin vishvasanam IshvarAbhimataM karmma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA te vyAharan bhavatA kiM lakShaNaM darshitaM yaddR^iShTvA bhavati vishvasiShyAmaH? tvayA kiM karmma kR^itaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>asmAkaM pUrvvapuruShA mahAprAntare mAnnAM bhokttuM prApuH yathA lipirAste| svargIyANi tu bhakShyANi pradadau parameshvaraH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravadad ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi mUsA yuShmAbhyaM svargIyaM bhakShyaM nAdAt kintu mama pitA yuShmAbhyaM svargIyaM paramaM bhakShyaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yaH svargAdavaruhya jagate jIvanaM dadAti sa IshvaradattabhakShyarUpaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA te prAvochan he prabho bhakShyamidaM nityamasmabhyaM dadAtu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yIshuravadad ahameva jIvanarUpaM bhakShyaM yo jano mama sannidhim AgachChati sa jAtu kShudhArtto na bhaviShyati, tathA yo jano mAM pratyeti sa jAtu tR^iShArtto na bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>mAM dR^iShTvApi yUyaM na vishvasitha yuShmAnaham ityavochaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>pitA mahyaM yAvato lokAnadadAt te sarvva eva mamAntikam AgamiShyanti yaH kashchichcha mama sannidhim AyAsyati taM kenApi prakAreNa na dUrIkariShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>nijAbhimataM sAdhayituM na hi kintu prerayiturabhimataM sAdhayituM svargAd Agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>sa yAn yAn lokAn mahyamadadAt teShAmekamapi na hArayitvA sheShadine sarvvAnaham utthApayAmi idaM matprerayituH piturabhimataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yaH kashchin mAnavasutaM vilokya vishvasiti sa sheShadine mayotthApitaH san anantAyuH prApsyati iti matprerakasyAbhimataM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA svargAd yad bhakShyam avArohat tad bhakShyam ahameva yihUdIyalokAstasyaitad vAkye vivadamAnA vakttumArebhire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>yUShaphaH putro yIshu ryasya mAtApitarau vayaM jAnIma eSha kiM saeva na? tarhi svargAd avAroham iti vAkyaM kathaM vaktti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAn pratyavadat parasparaM mA vivadadhvaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>matprerakeNa pitrA nAkR^iShTaH kopi jano mamAntikam AyAtuM na shaknoti kintvAgataM janaM charame.ahni protthApayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>te sarvva IshvareNa shikShitA bhaviShyanti bhaviShyadvAdinAM grantheShu lipiritthamAste ato yaH kashchit pituH sakAshAt shrutvA shikShate sa eva mama samIpam AgamiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>ya IshvarAd ajAyata taM vinA kopi manuShyo janakaM nAdarshat kevalaH saeva tAtam adrAkShIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAn yathArthataraM vadAmi yo jano mayi vishvAsaM karoti sonantAyuH prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>ahameva tajjIvanabhakShyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>yuShmAkaM pUrvvapuruShA mahAprAntare mannAbhakShyaM bhUkttApi mR^itAH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>kintu yadbhakShyaM svargAdAgachChat tad yadi kashchid bhu Nktte tarhi sa na mriyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>yajjIvanabhakShyaM svargAdAgachChat sohameva idaM bhakShyaM yo jano bhu Nktte sa nityajIvI bhaviShyati| punashcha jagato jIvanArthamahaM yat svakIyapishitaM dAsyAmi tadeva mayA vitaritaM bhakShyam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAH parasparaM vivadamAnA vakttumArebhire eSha bhojanArthaM svIyaM palalaM katham asmabhyaM dAsyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAn Avochad yuShmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi manuShyaputrasyAmiShe yuShmAbhi rna bhuktte tasya rudhire cha na pIte jIvanena sArddhaM yuShmAkaM sambandho nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yo mamAmiShaM svAdati mama sudhira ncha pivati sonantAyuH prApnoti tataH sheShe.ahni tamaham utthApayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>yato madIyamAmiShaM paramaM bhakShyaM tathA madIyaM shoNitaM paramaM peyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yo jano madIyaM palalaM svAdati madIyaM rudhira ncha pivati sa mayi vasati tasminnaha ncha vasAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>matprerayitrA jIvatA tAtena yathAhaM jIvAmi tadvad yaH kashchin mAmatti sopi mayA jIviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>yadbhakShyaM svargAdAgachChat tadidaM yanmAnnAM svAditvA yuShmAkaM pitaro.amriyanta tAdR^isham idaM bhakShyaM na bhavati idaM bhakShyaM yo bhakShati sa nityaM jIviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>yadA kapharnAhUm puryyAM bhajanagehe upAdishat tadA kathA etA akathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>tadetthaM shrutvA tasya shiShyANAm aneke parasparam akathayan idaM gADhaM vAkyaM vAkyamIdR^ishaM kaH shrotuM shakruyAt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>kintu yIshuH shiShyANAm itthaM vivAdaM svachitte vij nAya kathitavAn idaM vAkyaM kiM yuShmAkaM vighnaM janayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>yadi manujasutaM pUrvvavAsasthAnam UrdvvaM gachChantaM pashyatha tarhi kiM bhaviShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Atmaiva jIvanadAyakaH vapu rniShphalaM yuShmabhyamahaM yAni vachAMsi kathayAmi tAnyAtmA jIvana ncha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>kintu yuShmAkaM madhye kechana avishvAsinaH santi ke ke na vishvasanti ko vA taM parakareShu samarpayiShyati tAn yIshurAprathamAd vetti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>aparamapi kathitavAn asmAt kAraNAd akathayaM pituH sakAshAt shakttimaprApya kopi mamAntikam AgantuM na shaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>tatkAle.aneke shiShyA vyAghuTya tena sArddhaM puna rnAgachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>tadA yIshu rdvAdashashiShyAn ukttavAn yUyamapi kiM yAsyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>tataH shimon pitaraH pratyavochat he prabho kasyAbhyarNaM gamiShyAmaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>anantajIvanadAyinyo yAH kathAstAstavaiva| bhavAn amareshvarasyAbhiShikttaputra iti vishvasya nishchitaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravadat kimahaM yuShmAkaM dvAdashajanAn manonItAn na kR^itavAn? kintu yuShmAkaM madhyepi kashchideko vighnakArI vidyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>imAM kathaM sa shimonaH putram IShkarIyotIyaM yihUdAm uddishya kathitavAn yato dvAdashAnAM madhye gaNitaH sa taM parakareShu samarpayiShyati|</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yihUdIyalokAstaM hantuM samaihanta tasmAd yIshu ryihUdApradeshe paryyaTituM nechChan gAlIl pradeshe paryyaTituM prArabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>kintu tasmin samaye yihUdIyAnAM dUShyavAsanAmotsava upasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tasya bhrAtarastam avadan yAni karmmANi tvayA kriyante tAni yathA tava shiShyAH pashyanti tadarthaM tvamitaH sthAnAd yihUdIyadeshaM vraja|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yaH kashchit svayaM prachikAshiShati sa kadApi guptaM karmma na karoti yadIdR^ishaM karmma karoShi tarhi jagati nijaM parichAyaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yatastasya bhrAtaropi taM na vishvasanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAn avochat mama samaya idAnIM nopatiShThati kintu yuShmAkaM samayaH satatam upatiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>jagato lokA yuShmAn R^itIyituM na shakruvanti kintu mAmeva R^itIyante yatasteShAM karmANi duShTAni tatra sAkShyamidam ahaM dadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>ataeva yUyam utsave.asmin yAta nAham idAnIm asminnutsave yAmi yato mama samaya idAnIM na sampUrNaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>iti vAkyam ukttvA sa gAlIli sthitavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kintu tasya bhrAtR^iShu tatra prasthiteShu satsu so.aprakaTa utsavam agachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>anantaram utsavam upasthitA yihUdIyAstaM mR^igayitvApR^ichChan sa kutra?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tato lokAnAM madhye tasmin nAnAvidhA vivAdA bhavitum ArabdhavantaH| kechid avochan sa uttamaH puruShaH kechid avochan na tathA varaM lokAnAM bhramaM janayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu yihUdIyAnAM bhayAt kopi tasya pakShe spaShTaM nAkathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH param utsavasya madhyasamaye yIshu rmandiraM gatvA samupadishati sma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyA lokA AshcharyyaM j nAtvAkathayan eShA mAnuSho nAdhItyA katham etAdR^isho vidvAnabhUt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyavochad upadeshoyaM na mama kintu yo mAM preShitavAn tasya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yo jano nideshaM tasya grahIShyati mamopadesho matto bhavati kim IshvarAd bhavati sa ganastajj nAtuM shakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>yo janaH svataH kathayati sa svIyaM gauravam Ihate kintu yaH prerayitu rgauravam Ihate sa satyavAdI tasmin kopyadharmmo nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>mUsA yuShmabhyaM vyavasthAgranthaM kiM nAdadAt? kintu yuShmAkaM kopi tAM vyavasthAM na samAcharati| mAM hantuM kuto yatadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tadA lokA avadan tvaM bhUtagrastastvAM hantuM ko yatate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tato yIshuravochad ekaM karmma mayAkAri tasmAd yUyaM sarvva mahAshcharyyaM manyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>mUsA yuShmabhyaM tvakChedavidhiM pradadau sa mUsAto na jAtaH kintu pitR^ipuruShebhyo jAtaH tena vishrAmavAre.api mAnuShANAM tvakChedaM kurutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>ataeva vishrAmavAre manuShyANAM tvakChede kR^ite yadi mUsAvyavasthAma NganaM na bhavati tarhi mayA vishrAmavAre mAnuShaH sampUrNarUpeNa svastho.akAri tatkAraNAd yUyaM kiM mahyaM kupyatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>sapakShapAtaM vichAramakR^itvA nyAyyaM vichAraM kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yirUshAlam nivAsinaH katipayajanA akathayan ime yaM hantuM cheShTante sa evAyaM kiM na?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintu pashyata nirbhayaH san kathAM kathayati tathApi kimapi a vadantyete ayamevAbhiShiktto bhavatIti nishchitaM kimadhipatayo jAnanti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>manujoyaM kasmAdAgamad iti vayaM jAnomaH kintvabhiShiktta Agate sa kasmAdAgatavAn iti kopi j nAtuM na shakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA yIshu rmadhyemandiram upadishan uchchaiHkAram ukttavAn yUyaM kiM mAM jAnItha? kasmAchchAgatosmi tadapi kiM jAnItha? nAhaM svata Agatosmi kintu yaH satyavAdI saeva mAM preShitavAn yUyaM taM na jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tamahaM jAne tenAhaM prerita agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tasmAd yihUdIyAstaM dharttum udyatAstathApi kopi tasya gAtre hastaM nArpayad yato hetostadA tasya samayo nopatiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintu bahavo lokAstasmin vishvasya kathitavAnto.abhiShikttapuruSha Agatya mAnuShasyAsya kriyAbhyaH kim adhikA AshcharyyAH kriyAH kariShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>tataH paraM lokAstasmin itthaM vivadante phirUshinaH pradhAnayAjakA ncheti shrutavantastaM dhR^itvA netuM padAtigaNaM preShayAmAsuH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tato yIshuravadad aham alpadinAni yuShmAbhiH sArddhaM sthitvA matprerayituH samIpaM yAsyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>mAM mR^igayiShyadhve kintUddeshaM na lapsyadhve ratra sthAsyAmi tatra yUyaM gantuM na shakShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH parasparaM vakttumArebhire asyoddeshaM na prApsyAma etAdR^ishaM kiM sthAnaM yAsyati? bhinnadeshe vikIrNAnAM yihUdIyAnAM sannidhim eSha gatvA tAn upadekShyati kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>no chet mAM gaveShayiShyatha kintUddeshaM na prApsyatha eSha kodR^ishaM vAkyamidaM vadati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>anantaram utsavasya charame.ahani arthAt pradhAnadine yIshuruttiShThan uchchaiHkAram Ahvayan uditavAn yadi kashchit tR^iShArtto bhavati tarhi mamAntikam Agatya pivatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>yaH kashchinmayi vishvasiti dharmmagranthasya vachanAnusAreNa tasyAbhyantarato.amR^itatoyasya srotAMsi nirgamiShyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>ye tasmin vishvasanti ta AtmAnaM prApsyantItyarthe sa idaM vAkyaM vyAhR^itavAn etatkAlaM yAvad yIshu rvibhavaM na prAptastasmAt pavitra AtmA nAdIyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>etAM vANIM shrutvA bahavo lokA avadan ayameva nishchitaM sa bhaviShyadvAdI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>kechid akathayan eShaeva sobhiShikttaH kintu kechid avadan sobhiShikttaH kiM gAlIl pradeshe janiShyate?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>sobhiShiktto dAyUdo vaMshe dAyUdo janmasthAne baitlehami pattane janiShyate dharmmagranthe kimitthaM likhitaM nAsti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>itthaM tasmin lokAnAM bhinnavAkyatA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>katipayalokAstaM dharttum aichChan tathApi tadvapuShi kopi hastaM nArpayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>anantaraM pAdAtigaNe pradhAnayAjakAnAM phirUshinA ncha samIpamAgatavati te tAn apR^ichChan kuto hetostaM nAnayata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>tadA padAtayaH pratyavadan sa mAnava iva kopi kadApi nopAdishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tataH phirUshinaH prAvochan yUyamapi kimabhrAmiShTa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>adhipatInAM phirUshinA ncha kopi kiM tasmin vyashvasIt?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>ye shAstraM na jAnanti ta ime.adhamalokAeva shApagrastAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tadA nikadImanAmA teShAmeko yaH kShaNadAyAM yIshoH sannidhim agAt sa ukttavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>tasya vAkye na shrute karmmaNi cha na vidite .asmAkaM vyavasthA kiM ka nchana manujaM doShIkaroti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>tataste vyAharan tvamapi kiM gAlIlIyalokaH? vivichya pashya galIli kopi bhaviShyadvAdI notpadyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tataH paraM sarvve svaM svaM gR^ihaM gatAH kintu yIshu rjaitunanAmAnaM shilochchayaM gatavAn|</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>pratyUShe yIshuH panarmandiram AgachChat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tataH sarvveShu lokeShu tasya samIpa AgateShu sa upavishya tAn upadeShTum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA adhyApakAH phirUshina ncha vyabhichArakarmmaNi dhR^itaM striyamekAm Aniya sarvveShAM madhye sthApayitvA vyAharan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>he guro yoShitam imAM vyabhichArakarmma kurvvANAM lokA dhR^itavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>etAdR^ishalokAH pAShANAghAtena hantavyA iti vidhirmUsAvyavasthAgranthe likhitosti kintu bhavAn kimAdishati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>te tamapavadituM parIkShAbhiprAyeNa vAkyamidam apR^ichChan kintu sa prahvIbhUya bhUmAva NgalyA lekhitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tatastaiH punaH punaH pR^iShTa utthAya kathitavAn yuShmAkaM madhye yo jano niraparAdhI saeva prathamam enAM pAShANenAhantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>pashchAt sa punashcha prahvIbhUya bhUmau lekhitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tAM kathaM shrutvA te svasvamanasi prabodhaM prApya jyeShThAnukramaM ekaikashaH sarvve bahiragachChan tato yIshurekAkI tayakttobhavat madhyasthAne daNDAyamAnA sA yoShA cha sthitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tatpashchAd yIshurutthAya tAM vanitAM vinA kamapyaparaM na vilokya pR^iShTavAn he vAme tavApavAdakAH kutra? kopi tvAM kiM na daNDayati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>sAvadat he mahechCha kopi na tadA yIshuravochat nAhamapi daNDayAmi yAhi punaH pApaM mAkArShIH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tato yIshuH punarapi lokebhya itthaM kathayitum Arabhata jagatohaM jyotiHsvarUpo yaH kashchin matpashchAda gachChati sa timire na bhramitvA jIvanarUpAM dIptiM prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tataH phirUshino.avAdiShustvaM svArthe svayaM sAkShyaM dadAsi tasmAt tava sAkShyaM grAhyaM na bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyuditavAn yadyapi svArthe.ahaM svayaM sAkShyaM dadAmi tathApi mat sAkShyaM grAhyaM yasmAd ahaM kuta Agatosmi kva yAmi cha tadahaM jAnAmi kintu kuta Agatosmi kutra gachChAmi cha tad yUyaM na jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yUyaM laukikaM vichArayatha nAhaM kimapi vichArayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kintu yadi vichArayAmi tarhi mama vichAro grahItavyo yatoham ekAkI nAsmi prerayitA pitA mayA saha vidyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>dvayo rjanayoH sAkShyaM grahaNIyaM bhavatIti yuShmAkaM vyavasthAgranthe likhitamasti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM svArthe svayaM sAkShitvaM dadAmi yashcha mama tAto mAM preritavAn sopi madarthe sAkShyaM dadAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA te.apR^ichChan tava tAtaH kutra? tato yIshuH pratyavAdId yUyaM mAM na jAnItha matpitara ncha na jAnItha yadi mAm akShAsyata tarhi mama tAtamapyakShAsyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yIshu rmandira upadishya bhaNDAgAre kathA etA akathayat tathApi taM prati kopi karaM nodatolayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshuH punaruditavAn adhunAhaM gachChAmi yUyaM mAM gaveShayiShyatha kintu nijaiH pApai rmariShyatha yat sthAnam ahaM yAsyAmi tat sthAnam yUyaM yAtuM na shakShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH prAvochan kimayam AtmaghAtaM kariShyati? yato yat sthAnam ahaM yAsyAmi tat sthAnam yUyaM yAtuM na shakShyatha iti vAkyaM bravIti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIshustebhyaH kathitavAn yUyam adhaHsthAnIyA lokA aham UrdvvasthAnIyaH yUyam etajjagatsambandhIyA aham etajjagatsambandhIyo na|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasmAt kathitavAn yUyaM nijaiH pApai rmariShyatha yatohaM sa pumAn iti yadi na vishvasitha tarhi nijaiH pApai rmariShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA te .apR^ichChan kastvaM? tato yIshuH kathitavAn yuShmAkaM sannidhau yasya prastAvam A prathamAt karomi saeva puruShohaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yuShmAsu mayA bahuvAkyaM vakttavyaM vichArayitavya ncha kintu matprerayitA satyavAdI tasya samIpe yadahaM shrutavAn tadeva jagate kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu sa janake vAkyamidaM prokttavAn iti te nAbudhyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tato yIshurakathayad yadA manuShyaputram Urdvva utthApayiShyatha tadAhaM sa pumAn kevalaH svayaM kimapi karmma na karomi kintu tAto yathA shikShayati tadanusAreNa vAkyamidaM vadAmIti cha yUyaM j nAtuM shakShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>matprerayitA pitA mAm ekAkinaM na tyajati sa mayA sArddhaM tiShThati yatohaM tadabhimataM karmma sadA karomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA tasyaitAni vAkyAni shrutvA bahuvastAsmin vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ye yihUdIyA vyashvasan yIshustebhyo.akathayat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>mama vAkye yadi yUyam AsthAM kurutha tarhi mama shiShyA bhUtvA satyatvaM j nAsyatha tataH satyatayA yuShmAkaM mokSho bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadA te pratyavAdiShuH vayam ibrAhImo vaMshaH kadApi kasyApi dAsA na jAtAstarhi yuShmAkaM muktti rbhaviShyatIti vAkyaM kathaM bravIShi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyavadad yuShmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi yaH pApaM karoti sa pApasya dAsaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>dAsashcha nirantaraM niveshane na tiShThati kintu putro nirantaraM tiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataH putro yadi yuShmAn mochayati tarhi nitAntameva mukttA bhaviShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yuyam ibrAhImo vaMsha ityahaM jAnAmi kintu mama kathA yuShmAkam antaHkaraNeShu sthAnaM na prApnuvanti tasmAddheto rmAM hantum Ihadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>ahaM svapituH samIpe yadapashyaM tadeva kathayAmi tathA yUyamapi svapituH samIpe yadapashyata tadeva kurudhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA te pratyavochan ibrAhIm asmAkaM pitA tato yIshurakathayad yadi yUyam ibrAhImaH santAnA abhaviShyata tarhi ibrAhIma AchAraNavad AchariShyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ishvarasya mukhAt satyaM vAkyaM shrutvA yuShmAn j nApayAmi yohaM taM mAM hantuM cheShTadhve ibrAhIm etAdR^ishaM karmma na chakAra|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>yUyaM svasvapituH karmmANi kurutha tadA tairukttaM na vayaM jArajAtA asmAkam ekaeva pitAsti sa eveshvaraH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tato yIshunA kathitam Ishvaro yadi yuShmAkaM tAtobhaviShyat tarhi yUyaM mayi premAkariShyata yatoham IshvarAnnirgatyAgatosmi svato nAgatohaM sa mAM prAhiNot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>yUyaM mama vAkyamidaM na budhyadhve kutaH? yato yUyaM mamopadeshaM soDhuM na shaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>yUyaM shaitAn pituH santAnA etasmAd yuShmAkaM piturabhilAShaM pUrayatha sa A prathamAt naraghAtI tadantaH satyatvasya leshopi nAsti kAraNAdataH sa satyatAyAM nAtiShThat sa yadA mR^iShA kathayati tadA nijasvabhAvAnusAreNaiva kathayati yato sa mR^iShAbhAShI mR^iShotpAdakashcha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>ahaM tathyavAkyaM vadAmi kAraNAdasmAd yUyaM mAM na pratItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>mayi pApamastIti pramANaM yuShmAkaM ko dAtuM shaknoti? yadyahaM tathyavAkyaM vadAmi tarhi kuto mAM na pratitha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>yaH kashchana IshvarIyo lokaH sa IshvarIyakathAyAM mano nidhatte yUyam IshvarIyalokA na bhavatha tannidAnAt tatra na manAMsi nidhadve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyAH pratyavAdiShuH tvamekaH shomiroNIyo bhUtagrastashcha vayaM kimidaM bhadraM nAvAdiShma?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyavAdIt nAhaM bhUtagrastaH kintu nijatAtaM sammanye tasmAd yUyaM mAm apamanyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>ahaM svasukhyAtiM na cheShTe kintu cheShTitA vichArayitA chApara eka Aste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmabhyam atIva yathArthaM kathayAmi yo naro madIyaM vAchaM manyate sa kadAchana nidhanaM na drakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>yihUdIyAstamavadan tvaM bhUtagrasta itIdAnIm avaiShma| ibrAhIm bhaviShyadvAdina ncha sarvve mR^itAH kintu tvaM bhAShase yo naro mama bhAratIM gR^ihlAti sa jAtu nidhAnAsvAdaM na lapsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>tarhi tvaM kim asmAkaM pUrvvapuruShAd ibrAhImopi mahAn? yasmAt sopi mR^itaH bhaviShyadvAdinopi mR^itAH tvaM svaM kaM pumAMsaM manuShe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyavochad yadyahaM svaM svayaM sammanye tarhi mama tat sammananaM kimapi na kintu mama tAto yaM yUyaM svIyam IshvaraM bhAShadhve saeva mAM sammanute|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>yUyaM taM nAvagachChatha kintvahaM tamavagachChAmi taM nAvagachChAmIti vAkyaM yadi vadAmi tarhi yUyamiva mR^iShAbhAShI bhavAmi kintvahaM tamavagachChAmi tadAkShAmapi gR^ihlAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yuShmAkaM pUrvvapuruSha ibrAhIm mama samayaM draShTum atIvAvA nChat tannirIkShyAnandachcha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>tadA yihUdIyA apR^ichChan tava vayaH pa nchAshadvatsarA na tvaM kim ibrAhImam adrAkShIH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyavAdId yuShmAnahaM yathArthataraM vadAmi ibrAhImo janmanaH pUrvvakAlamArabhyAhaM vidye|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>tadA te pAShANAn uttolya tamAhantum udayachChan kintu yIshu rgupto mantirAd bahirgatya teShAM madhyena prasthitavAn|</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshurgachChan mArgamadhye janmAndhaM naram apashyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tataH shiShyAstam apR^ichChan he guro naroyaM svapApena vA svapitrAH pApenAndho.ajAyata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataH sa pratyuditavAn etasya vAsya pitroH pApAd etAdR^ishobhUda iti nahi kintvanena yatheshvarasya karmma prakAshyate taddhetoreva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>dine tiShThati matprerayituH karmma mayA karttavyaM yadA kimapi karmma na kriyate tAdR^ishI nishAgachChati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ahaM yAvatkAlaM jagati tiShThAmi tAvatkAlaM jagato jyotiHsvarUposmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>ityukttA bhUmau niShThIvaM nikShipya tena pa NkaM kR^itavAn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>pashchAt tatpa Nkena tasyAndhasya netre pralipya tamityAdishat gatvA shilohe .arthAt preritanAmni sarasi snAhi| tatondho gatvA tatrAsnAt tataH prannachakShu rbhUtvA vyAghuTyAgAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>apara ncha samIpavAsino lokA ye cha taM pUrvvamandham apashyan te bakttum Arabhanta yondhaloko vartmanyupavishyAbhikShata sa evAyaM janaH kiM na bhavati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>kechidavadan sa eva kechidavochan tAdR^isho bhavati kintu sa svayamabravIt sa evAhaM bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ataeva te .apR^ichChan tvaM kathaM dR^iShTiM pAptavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH sovadad yIshanAmaka eko jano mama nayane pa Nkena pralipya ityAj nApayat shilohakAsAraM gatvA tatra snAhi| tatastatra gatvA mayi snAte dR^iShTimahaM labdhavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA te .avadan sa pumAn kutra? tenokttaM nAhaM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>aparaM tasmin pUrvvAndhe jane phirUshinAM nikaTam AnIte sati phirUshinopi tamapR^ichChan kathaM dR^iShTiM prAptosi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tataH sa kathitavAn sa pa Nkena mama netre .alimpat pashchAd snAtvA dR^iShTimalabhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu yIshu rvishrAmavAre karddamaM kR^itvA tasya nayane prasanne.akarod itikAraNAt katipayaphirUshino.avadan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>sa pumAn IshvarAnna yataH sa vishrAmavAraM na manyate| tatonye kechit pratyavadan pApI pumAn kim etAdR^isham AshcharyyaM karmma karttuM shaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>itthaM teShAM parasparaM bhinnavAkyatvam abhavat| pashchAt te punarapi taM pUrvvAndhaM mAnuSham aprAkShuH yo janastava chakShuShI prasanne kR^itavAn tasmin tvaM kiM vadasi? sa ukttavAn sa bhavishadvAdI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sa dR^iShTim AptavAn iti yihUdIyAstasya dR^iShTiM prAptasya janasya pitro rmukhAd ashrutvA na pratyayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>ataeva te tAvapR^ichChan yuvayo ryaM putraM janmAndhaM vadathaH sa kimayaM? tarhIdAnIM kathaM draShTuM shaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tatastasya pitarau pratyavochatAm ayam AvayoH putra A janerandhashcha tadapyAvAM jAnIvaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintvadhunA kathaM dR^iShTiM prAptavAn tadAvAM n jAnIvaH kosya chakShuShI prasanne kR^itavAn tadapi na jAnIva eSha vayaHprApta enaM pR^ichChata svakathAM svayaM vakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAM bhayAt tasya pitarau vAkyamidam avadatAM yataH kopi manuShyo yadi yIshum abhiShiktaM vadati tarhi sa bhajanagR^ihAd dUrIkAriShyate yihUdIyA iti mantraNAm akurvvan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>atastasya pitarau vyAharatAm eSha vayaHprApta enaM pR^ichChata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tadA te punashcha taM pUrvvAndham AhUya vyAharan Ishvarasya guNAn vada eSha manuShyaH pApIti vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sa ukttavAn sa pApI na veti nAhaM jAne pUrvAmandha Asamaham adhunA pashyAmIti mAtraM jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>te punarapR^ichChan sa tvAM prati kimakarot? kathaM netre prasanne .akarot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tataH sovAdId ekakR^itvokathayaM yUyaM na shR^iNutha tarhi kutaH punaH shrotum ichChatha? yUyamapi kiM tasya shiShyA bhavitum ichChatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA te taM tiraskR^itya vyAharan tvaM tasya shiShyo vayaM mUsAH shiShyAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>mUsAvaktreNeshvaro jagAda tajjAnImaH kintveSha kutratyaloka iti na jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>sovadad eSha mama lochane prasanne .akarot tathApi kutratyaloka iti yUyaM na jAnItha etad AshcharyyaM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>IshvaraH pApinAM kathAM na shR^iNoti kintu yo janastasmin bhaktiM kR^itvA tadiShTakriyAM karoti tasyaiva kathAM shR^iNoti etad vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>kopi manuShyo janmAndhAya chakShuShI adadAt jagadArambhAd etAdR^ishIM kathAM kopi kadApi nAshR^iNot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>asmAd eSha manuShyo yadIshvarAnnAjAyata tarhi ki nchidapIdR^ishaM karmma karttuM nAshaknot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>te vyAharan tvaM pApAd ajAyathAH kimasmAn tvaM shikShayasi? pashchAtte taM bahirakurvvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadanantaraM yihUdIyaiH sa bahirakriyata yIshuriti vArttAM shrutvA taM sAkShAt prApya pR^iShTavAn Ishvarasya putre tvaM vishvasiShi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tadA sa pratyavochat he prabho sa ko yat tasminnahaM vishvasimi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tato yIshuH kathitavAn tvaM taM dR^iShTavAn tvayA sAkaM yaH kathaM kathayati saeva saH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA he prabho vishvasimItyuktvA sa taM praNAmat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>pashchAd yIshuH kathitavAn nayanahInA nayanAni prApnuvanti nayanavantashchAndhA bhavantItyabhiprAyeNa jagadAham AgachCham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>etat shrutvA nikaTasthAH katipayAH phirUshino vyAharan vayamapi kimandhAH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravAdId yadyandhA abhavata tarhi pApAni nAtiShThan kintu pashyAmIti vAkyavadanAd yuShmAkaM pApAni tiShThanti|</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, yo jano dvAreNa na pravishya kenApyanyena meShagR^ihaM pravishati sa eva steno dasyushcha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yo dvAreNa pravishati sa eva meShapAlakaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>dauvArikastasmai dvAraM mochayati meShagaNashcha tasya vAkyaM shR^iNoti sa nijAn meShAn svasvanAmnAhUya bahiH kR^itvA nayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tathA nijAn meShAn bahiH kR^itvA svayaM teShAm agre gachChati, tato meShAstasya shabdaM budhyante, tasmAt tasya pashchAd vrajanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>kintu parasya shabdaM na budhyante tasmAt tasya pashchAd vrajiShyanti varaM tasya samIpAt palAyiShyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIshustebhya imAM dR^iShTAntakathAm akathayat kintu tena kathitakathAyAstAtparyyaM te nAbudhyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>ato yIshuH punarakathayat, yuShmAnAhaM yathArthataraM vyAharAmi, meShagR^ihasya dvAram ahameva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>mayA na pravishya ya AgachChan te stenA dasyavashcha kintu meShAsteShAM kathA nAshR^iNvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>ahameva dvArasvarUpaH, mayA yaH kashchita pravishati sa rakShAM prApsyati tathA bahirantashcha gamanAgamane kR^itvA charaNasthAnaM prApsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yo janastenaH sa kevalaM stainyabadhavinAshAn karttumeva samAyAti kintvaham Ayu rdAtum arthAt bAhUlyena tadeva dAtum AgachCham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ahameva satyameShapAlako yastu satyo meShapAlakaH sa meShArthaM prANatyAgaM karoti;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>kintu yo jano meShapAlako na, arthAd yasya meShA nijA na bhavanti, ya etAdR^isho vaitanikaH sa vR^ikam AgachChantaM dR^iShTvA mejavrajaM vihAya palAyate, tasmAd vR^ikastaM vrajaM dhR^itvA vikirati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>vaitanikaH palAyate yataH sa vetanArthI meShArthaM na chintayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ahameva satyo meShapAlakaH, pitA mAM yathA jAnAti, aha ncha yathA pitaraM jAnAmi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tathA nijAn meShAnapi jAnAmi, meShAshcha mAM jAnAnti, aha ncha meShArthaM prANatyAgaM karomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>apara ncha etad gR^ihIya meShebhyo bhinnA api meShA mama santi te sakalA AnayitavyAH; te mama shabdaM shroShyanti tata eko vraja eko rakShako bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>prANAnahaM tyaktvA punaH prANAn grahIShyAmi, tasmAt pitA mayi snehaM karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>kashchijjano mama prANAn hantuM na shaknoti kintu svayaM tAn samarpayAmi tAn samarpayituM punargrahItu ncha mama shaktirAste bhAramimaM svapituH sakAshAt prAptoham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>asmAdupadeshAt punashcha yihUdIyAnAM madhye bhinnavAkyatA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>tato bahavo vyAharan eSha bhUtagrasta unmattashcha, kuta etasya kathAM shR^iNutha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kechid avadan etasya kathA bhUtagrastasya kathAvanna bhavanti, bhUtaH kim andhAya chakShuShI dAtuM shaknoti?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>shItakAle yirUshAlami mandirotsargaparvvaNyupasthite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yIshuH sulemAno niHsAreNa gamanAgamane karoti,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>etasmin samaye yihUdIyAstaM veShTayitvA vyAharan kati kAlAn asmAkaM vichikitsAM sthApayiShyAmi? yadyabhiShikto bhavati tarhi tat spaShTaM vada|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyavadad aham achakathaM kintu yUyaM na pratItha, nijapitu rnAmnA yAM yAM kriyAM karomi sA kriyaiva mama sAkShisvarUpA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintvahaM pUrvvamakathayaM yUyaM mama meShA na bhavatha, kAraNAdasmAn na vishvasitha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>mama meShA mama shabdaM shR^iNvanti tAnahaM jAnAmi te cha mama pashchAd gachChanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM tebhyo.anantAyu rdadAmi, te kadApi na naMkShyanti kopi mama karAt tAn harttuM na shakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yo mama pitA tAn mahyaM dattavAn sa sarvvasmAt mahAn, kopi mama pituH karAt tAn harttuM na shakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>ahaM pitA cha dvayorekatvam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tato yihUdIyAH punarapi taM hantuM pAShANAn udatolayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yIshuH kathitavAn pituH sakAshAd bahUnyuttamakarmmANi yuShmAkaM prAkAshayaM teShAM kasya karmmaNaH kAraNAn mAM pAShANairAhantum udyatAH stha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yihUdIyAH pratyavadan prashastakarmmaheto rna kintu tvaM mAnuShaH svamIshvaram uktveshvaraM nindasi kAraNAdasmAt tvAM pAShANairhanmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyuktavAn mayA kathitaM yUyam IshvarA etadvachanaM yuShmAkaM shAstre likhitaM nAsti kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tasmAd yeShAm uddeshe Ishvarasya kathA kathitA te yadIshvaragaNA uchyante dharmmagranthasyApyanyathA bhavituM na shakyaM,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tarhyAham Ishvarasya putra iti vAkyasya kathanAt yUyaM pitrAbhiShiktaM jagati prerita ncha pumAMsaM katham IshvaranindakaM vAdaya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yadyahaM pituH karmma na karomi tarhi mAM na pratIta;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>kintu yadi karomi tarhi mayi yuShmAbhiH pratyaye na kR^ite.api kAryye pratyayaH kriyatAM, tato mayi pitAstIti pitaryyaham asmIti cha kShAtvA vishvasiShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA te punarapi taM dharttum acheShTanta kintu sa teShAM karebhyo nistIryya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>puna ryarddan adyAstaTe yatra purvvaM yohan amajjayat tatrAgatya nyavasat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tato bahavo lokAstatsamIpam Agatya vyAharan yohan kimapyAshcharyyaM karmma nAkarot kintvasmin manuShye yA yaH kathA akathayat tAH sarvvAH satyAH;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tatra cha bahavo lokAstasmin vyashvasan|</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM mariyam tasyA bhaginI marthA cha yasmin vaithanIyAgrAme vasatastasmin grAme iliyAsar nAmA pIDita eka AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>yA mariyam prabhuM sugandhitelaina marddayitvA svakeshaistasya charaNau samamArjat tasyA bhrAtA sa iliyAsar rogI|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>apara ncha he prabho bhavAn yasmin prIyate sa eva pIDitostIti kathAM kathayitvA tasya bhaginyau preShitavatyau|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA yIshurimAM vArttAM shrutvAkathayata pIDeyaM maraNArthaM na kintvIshvarasya mahimArtham Ishvaraputrasya mahimaprakAshArtha ncha jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>yIshu ryadyapimarthAyAM tadbhaginyAm iliyAsari chAprIyata,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tathApi iliyAsaraH pIDAyAH kathaM shrutvA yatra AsIt tatraiva dinadvayamatiShThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tataH param sa shiShyAnakathayad vayaM puna ryihUdIyapradeshaM yAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataste pratyavadan, he guro svalpadinAni gatAni yihUdIyAstvAM pAShANai rhantum udyatAstathApi kiM punastatra yAsyasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyavadat, ekasmin dine kiM dvAdashaghaTikA na bhavanti? kopi divA gachChan na skhalati yataH sa etajjagato dIptiM prApnoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>kintu rAtrau gachChan skhalati yato hetostatra dIpti rnAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>imAM kathAM kathayitvA sa tAnavadad, asmAkaM bandhuH iliyAsar nidritobhUd idAnIM taM nidrAto jAgarayituM gachChAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yIshu rmR^itau kathAmimAM kathitavAn kintu vishrAmArthaM nidrAyAM kathitavAn iti j nAtvA shiShyA akathayan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>he guro sa yadi nidrAti tarhi bhadrameva|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH spaShTaM tAn vyAharat, iliyAsar amriyata;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu yUyaM yathA pratItha tadarthamahaM tatra na sthitavAn ityasmAd yuShmannimittam AhlAditohaM, tathApi tasya samIpe yAma|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA thomA yaM didumaM vadanti sa sa NginaH shiShyAn avadad vayamapi gatvA tena sArddhaM mriyAmahai|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yIshustatropasthAya iliyAsaraH shmashAne sthApanAt chatvAri dinAni gatAnIti vArttAM shrutavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>vaithanIyA yirUshAlamaH samIpasthA kroshaikamAtrAntaritA;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tasmAd bahavo yihUdIyA marthAM mariyama ncha bhyAtR^ishokApannAM sAntvayituM tayoH samIpam AgachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>marthA yIshorAgamanavArtAM shrutvaiva taM sAkShAd akarot kintu mariyam geha upavishya sthitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>tadA marthA yIshumavAdat, he prabho yadi bhavAn atrAsthAsyat tarhi mama bhrAtA nAmariShyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>kintvidAnImapi yad Ishvare prArthayiShyate Ishvarastad dAsyatIti jAne.ahaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yIshuravAdIt tava bhrAtA samutthAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>marthA vyAharat sheShadivase sa utthAnasamaye protthAsyatIti jAne.ahaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH kathitavAn ahameva utthApayitA jIvayitA cha yaH kashchana mayi vishvasiti sa mR^itvApi jIviShyati;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yaH kashchana cha jIvan mayi vishvasiti sa kadApi na mariShyati, asyAM kathAyAM kiM vishvasiShi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sAvadat prabho yasyAvataraNApekShAsti bhavAn saevAbhiShiktta Ishvaraputra iti vishvasimi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>iti kathAM kathayitvA sA gatvA svAM bhaginIM mariyamaM guptamAhUya vyAharat gururupatiShThati tvAmAhUyati cha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kathAmimAM shrutvA sA tUrNam utthAya tasya samIpam agachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>yIshu rgrAmamadhyaM na pravishya yatra marthA taM sAkShAd akarot tatra sthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ye yihUdIyA mariyamA sAkaM gR^ihe tiShThantastAm asAntvayana te tAM kShipram utthAya gachChantiM vilokya vyAharan, sa shmashAne rodituM yAti, ityuktvA te tasyAH pashchAd agachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yatra yIshuratiShThat tatra mariyam upasthAya taM dR^iShTvA tasya charaNayoH patitvA vyAharat he prabho yadi bhavAn atrAsthAsyat tarhi mama bhrAtA nAmariShyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yIshustAM tasyAH sa Ngino yihUdIyAMshcha rudato vilokya shokArttaH san dIrghaM nishvasya kathitavAn taM kutrAsthApayata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>te vyAharan, he prabho bhavAn Agatya pashyatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yIshunA kranditaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataeva yihUdIyA avadan, pashyatAyaM tasmin kidR^ig apriyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>teShAM kechid avadan yondhAya chakShuShI dattavAn sa kim asya mR^ityuM nivArayituM nAshaknot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIshuH punarantardIrghaM nishvasya shmashAnAntikam agachChat| tat shmashAnam ekaM gahvaraM tanmukhe pAShANa eka AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravadad enaM pAShANam apasArayata, tataH pramItasya bhaginI marthAvadat prabho, adhunA tatra durgandho jAtaH, yatodya chatvAri dinAni shmashAne sa tiShThati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravAdIt, yadi vishvasiShi tarhIshvarasya mahimaprakAshaM drakShyasi kathAmimAM kiM tubhyaM nAkathayaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>tadA mR^itasya shmashAnAt pAShANo.apasArite yIshurUrdvvaM pashyan akathayat, he pita rmama nevesanam ashR^iNoH kAraNAdasmAt tvAM dhanyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tvaM satataM shR^iNoShi tadapyahaM jAnAmi, kintu tvaM mAM yat prairayastad yathAsmin sthAne sthitA lokA vishvasanti tadartham idaM vAkyaM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>imAM kathAM kathayitvA sa prochchairAhvayat, he iliyAsar bahirAgachCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tataH sa pramItaH shmashAnavastrai rbaddhahastapAdo gAtramArjanavAsasA baddhamukhashcha bahirAgachChat| yIshuruditavAn bandhanAni mochayitvA tyajatainaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>mariyamaH samIpam AgatA ye yihUdIyalokAstadA yIshoretat karmmApashyan teShAM bahavo vyashvasan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>kintu kechidanye phirUshinAM samIpaM gatvA yIshoretasya karmmaNo vArttAm avadan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>tataH paraM pradhAnayAjakAH phirUshinAshcha sabhAM kR^itvA vyAharan vayaM kiM kurmmaH? eSha mAnavo bahUnyAshcharyyakarmmANi karoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>yadIdR^ishaM karmma karttuM na vArayAmastarhi sarvve lokAstasmin vishvasiShyanti romilokAshchAgatyAsmAkam anayA rAjadhAnyA sArddhaM rAjyam AChetsyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>tadA teShAM kiyaphAnAmA yastasmin vatsare mahAyAjakapade nyayujyata sa pratyavadad yUyaM kimapi na jAnItha;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>samagradeshasya vinAshatopi sarvvalokArtham ekasya janasya maraNam asmAkaM ma Ngalahetukam etasya vivechanAmapi na kurutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>etAM kathAM sa nijabuddhyA vyAharad iti na,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>kintu yIshUstaddeshIyAnAM kAraNAt prANAn tyakShyati, dishi dishi vikIrNAn Ishvarasya santAnAn saMgR^ihyaikajAtiM kariShyati cha, tasmin vatsare kiyaphA mahAyAjakatvapade niyuktaH san idaM bhaviShyadvAkyaM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>taddinamArabhya te kathaM taM hantuM shaknuvantIti mantraNAM karttuM prArebhire|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>ataeva yihUdIyAnAM madhye yIshuH saprakAshaM gamanAgamane akR^itvA tasmAd gatvA prAntarasya samIpasthAyipradeshasyephrAyim nAmni nagare shiShyaiH sAkaM kAlaM yApayituM prArebhe|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>anantaraM yihUdIyAnAM nistArotsave nikaTavarttini sati tadutsavAt pUrvvaM svAn shuchIn karttuM bahavo janA grAmebhyo yirUshAlam nagaram AgachChan,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>yIshoranveShaNaM kR^itvA mandire daNDAyamAnAH santaH parasparaM vyAharan, yuShmAkaM kIdR^isho bodho jAyate? sa kim utsave.asmin atrAgamiShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>sa cha kutrAsti yadyetat kashchid vetti tarhi darshayatu pradhAnayAjakAH phirUshinashcha taM dharttuM pUrvvam imAm Aj nAM prAchArayan|</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nistArotsavAt pUrvvaM dinaShaTke sthite yIshu ryaM pramItam iliyAsaraM shmashAnAd udasthAparat tasya nivAsasthAnaM baithaniyAgrAmam AgachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tatra tadarthaM rajanyAM bhojye kR^ite marthA paryyaveShayad iliyAsar cha tasya sa NgibhiH sArddhaM bhojanAsana upAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA mariyam arddhaseTakaM bahumUlyaM jaTAmAMsIyaM tailam AnIya yIshoshcharaNayo rmarddayitvA nijakesha rmArShTum Arabhata; tadA tailasya parimalena gR^iham Amoditam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>yaH shimonaH putra riShkariyotIyo yihUdAnAmA yIshuM parakareShu samarpayiShyati sa shiShyastadA kathitavAn,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>etattailaM tribhiH shatai rmudrApadai rvikrItaM sad daridrebhyaH kuto nAdIyata?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>sa daridralokArtham achintayad iti na, kintu sa chaura evaM tannikaTe mudrAsampuTakasthityA tanmadhye yadatiShThat tadapAharat tasmAt kAraNAd imAM kathAmakathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tadA yIshurakathayad enAM mA vAraya sA mama shmashAnasthApanadinArthaM tadarakShayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>daridrA yuShmAkaM sannidhau sarvvadA tiShThanti kintvahaM sarvvadA yuShmAkaM sannidhau na tiShThAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshustatrAstIti vArttAM shrutvA bahavo yihUdIyAstaM shmashAnAdutthApitam iliyAsara ncha draShTuM tat sthAnam AgachChana|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadA pradhAnayAjakAstam iliyAsaramapi saMharttum amantrayan ;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yatastena bahavo yihUdIyA gatvA yIshau vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>anantaraM yIshu ryirUshAlam nagaram AgachChatIti vArttAM shrutvA pare.ahani utsavAgatA bahavo lokAH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kharjjUrapatrAdyAnIya taM sAkShAt karttuM bahirAgatya jaya jayeti vAchaM prochchai rvaktum Arabhanta, isrAyelo yo rAjA parameshvarasya nAmnAgachChati sa dhanyaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tadA "he siyonaH kanye mA bhaiShIH pashyAyaM tava rAjA garddabhashAvakam AruhyAgachChati"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>iti shAstrIyavachanAnusAreNa yIshurekaM yuvagarddabhaM prApya taduparyyArohat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>asyAH ghaTanAyAstAtparyyaM shiShyAH prathamaM nAbudhyanta, kintu yIshau mahimAnaM prApte sati vAkyamidaM tasmina akathyata lokAshcha tampratIttham akurvvan iti te smR^itavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>sa iliyAsaraM shmashAnAd Agantum AhvatavAn shmashAnA ncha udasthApayad ye ye lokAstatkarmya sAkShAd apashyan te pramANaM dAtum Arabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sa etAdR^isham adbhutaM karmmakarot tasya janashrute rlokAstaM sAkShAt karttum AgachChan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataH phirUshinaH parasparaM vaktum Arabhanta yuShmAkaM sarvvAshcheShTA vR^ithA jAtAH, iti kiM yUyaM na budhyadhve? pashyata sarvve lokAstasya pashchAdvarttinobhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>bhajanaM karttum utsavAgatAnAM lokAnAM katipayA janA anyadeshIyA Asan ,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>te gAlIlIyabaitsaidAnivAsinaH philipasya samIpam Agatya vyAharan he mahechCha vayaM yIshuM draShTum ichChAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH philipo gatvA Andriyam avadat pashchAd Andriyaphilipau yIshave vArttAm akathayatAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyuditavAn mAnavasutasya mahimaprAptisamaya upasthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, dhAnyabIjaM mR^ittikAyAM patitvA yadi na mR^iyate tarhyekAkI tiShThati kintu yadi mR^iyate tarhi bahuguNaM phalaM phalati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yo janeा nijaprANAn priyAn jAnAti sa tAn hArayiShyati kintu yeा jana ihaloke nijaprANAn apriyAn jAnAti seाnantAyuH prAptuM tAn rakShiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kashchid yadi mama sevako bhavituM vA nChati tarhi sa mama pashchAdgAmI bhavatu, tasmAd ahaM yatra tiShThAmi mama sevakeाpi tatra sthAsyati; yo jano mAM sevate mama pitApi taM sammaMsyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>sAmprataM mama prANA vyAkulA bhavanti, tasmAd he pitara etasmAt samayAn mAM rakSha, ityahaM kiM prArthayiShye? kintvaham etatsamayArtham avatIrNavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>he pita: svanAmno mahimAnaM prakAshaya; tanaiva svanAmno mahimAnam ahaM prAkAshayaM punarapi prakAshayiShyAmi, eShA gagaNIyA vANI tasmin samaye.ajAyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tachshrutvA samIpasthalokAnAM kechid avadan megho.agarjIt, kechid avadan svargIyadUto.anena saha kathAmachakathat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyavAdIt, madarthaM shabdoyaM nAbhUt yuShmadarthamevAbhUt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>adhunA jagatosya vichAra: sampatsyate, adhunAsya jagata: patI rAjyAt chyoShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yadyaI pR^ithivyA Urdvve protthApitosmi tarhi sarvvAn mAnavAn svasamIpam AkarShiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kathaM tasya mR^iti rbhaviShyati, etad bodhayituM sa imAM kathAm akathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>tadA lokA akathayan sobhiShiktaH sarvvadA tiShThatIti vyavasthAgranthe shrutam asmAbhiH, tarhi manuShyaputraH protthApito bhaviShyatIti vAkyaM kathaM vadasi? manuShyaputroyaM kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tadA yIshurakathAyad yuShmAbhiH sArddham alpadinAni jyotirAste, yathA yuShmAn andhakAro nAchChAdayati tadarthaM yAvatkAlaM yuShmAbhiH sArddhaM jyotistiShThati tAvatkAlaM gachChata; yo jano.andhakAre gachChati sa kutra yAtIti na jAnAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>ataeva yAvatkAlaM yuShmAkaM nikaTe jyotirAste tAvatkAlaM jyotIrUpasantAnA bhavituM jyotiShi vishvasita; imAM kathAM kathayitvA yIshuH prasthAya tebhyaH svaM guptavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>yadyapi yIshusteShAM samakSham etAvadAshcharyyakarmmANi kR^itavAn tathApi te tasmin na vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>ataeva kaH pratyeti susaMvAdaM pareshAsmat prachAritaM? prakAshate pareshasya hastaH kasya cha sannidhau? yishayiyabhaviShyadvAdinA yadetad vAkyamuktaM tat saphalam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>te pratyetuM nAshankuvan tasmin yishayiyabhaviShyadvAdi punaravAdId,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>yadA, "te nayanai rna pashyanti buddhibhishcha na budhyante tai rmanaHsu parivarttiteShu cha tAnahaM yathA svasthAn na karomi tathA sa teShAM lochanAnyandhAni kR^itvA teShAmantaHkaraNAni gADhAni kariShyati|"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>yishayiyo yadA yIsho rmahimAnaM vilokya tasmin kathAmakathayat tadA bhaviShyadvAkyam IdR^ishaM prakAshayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>tathApyadhipatinAM bahavastasmin pratyAyan| kintu phirUshinastAn bhajanagR^ihAd dUrIkurvvantIti bhayAt te taM na svIkR^itavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>yata Ishvarasya prashaMsAto mAnavAnAM prashaMsAyAM te.apriyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>tadA yIshuruchchaiHkAram akathayad yo jano mayi vishvasiti sa kevale mayi vishvasitIti na, sa matprerake.api vishvasiti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>yo jano mAM pashyati sa matprerakamapi pashyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>yo jano mAM pratyeti sa yathAndhakAre na tiShThati tadartham ahaM jyotiHsvarUpo bhUtvA jagatyasmin avatIrNavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>mama kathAM shrutvA yadi kashchin na vishvasiti tarhi tamahaM doShiNaM na karomi, yato heto rjagato janAnAM doShAn nishchitAn karttuM nAgatya tAn parichAtum Agatosmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>yaH kashchin mAM na shraddhAya mama kathaM na gR^ihlAti, anyastaM doShiNaM kariShyati vastutastu yAM kathAmaham achakathaM sA kathA charame.anhi taM doShiNaM kariShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>yato hetorahaM svataH kimapi na kathayAmi, kiM kiM mayA kathayitavyaM kiM samupadeShTavya ncha iti matprerayitA pitA mAmAj nApayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>tasya sAj nA anantAyurityahaM jAnAmi, ataevAhaM yat kathayAmi tat pitA yathAj nApayat tathaiva kathayAmyaham|</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>nistArotsavasya ki nchitkAlAt pUrvvaM pR^ithivyAH pituH samIpagamanasya samayaH sannikarShobhUd iti j nAtvA yIshurAprathamAd yeShu jagatpravAsiShvAtmIyalokeSha prema karoti sma teShu sheShaM yAvat prema kR^itavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pitA tasya haste sarvvaM samarpitavAn svayam Ishvarasya samIpAd AgachChad Ishvarasya samIpaM yAsyati cha, sarvvANyetAni j nAtvA rajanyAM bhojane sampUrNe sati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yadA shaitAn taM parahasteShu samarpayituM shimonaH putrasya IShkAriyotiyasya yihUdA antaHkaraNe kupravR^ittiM samArpayat,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA yIshu rbhojanAsanAd utthAya gAtravastraM mochayitvA gAtramArjanavastraM gR^ihItvA tena svakaTim abadhnAt,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>pashchAd ekapAtre jalam abhiShichya shiShyANAM pAdAn prakShAlya tena kaTibaddhagAtramArjanavAsasA mArShTuM prArabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tataH shimonpitarasya samIpamAgate sa uktavAn he prabho bhavAn kiM mama pAdau prakShAlayiShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yIshuruditavAn ahaM yat karomi tat samprati na jAnAsi kintu pashchAj j nAsyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH pitaraH kathitavAn bhavAn kadApi mama pAdau na prakShAlayiShyati| yIshurakathayad yadi tvAM na prakShAlaye tarhi mayi tava kopyaMsho nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tadA shimonpitaraH kathitavAn he prabho tarhi kevalapAdau na, mama hastau shirashcha prakShAlayatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIshuravadad yo jano dhautastasya sarvvA NgapariShkR^itatvAt pAdau vinAnyA Ngasya prakShAlanApekShA nAsti| yUyaM pariShkR^itA iti satyaM kintu na sarvve,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yato yo janastaM parakareShu samarpayiShyati taM sa j nAtavAna; ataeva yUyaM sarvve na pariShkR^itA imAM kathAM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>itthaM yIshusteShAM pAdAn prakShAlya vastraM paridhAyAsane samupavishya kathitavAn ahaM yuShmAn prati kiM karmmAkArShaM jAnItha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yUyaM mAM guruM prabhu ncha vadatha tat satyameva vadatha yatohaM saeva bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yadyahaM prabhu rgurushcha san yuShmAkaM pAdAn prakShAlitavAn tarhi yuShmAkamapi parasparaM pAdaprakShAlanam uchitam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAn prati yathA vyavAharaM yuShmAn tathA vyavaharttum ekaM panthAnaM darshitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, prabho rdAso na mahAn prerakAchcha prerito na mahAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>imAM kathAM viditvA yadi tadanusArataH karmmANi kurutha tarhi yUyaM dhanyA bhaviShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>sarvveShu yuShmAsu kathAmimAM kathayAmi iti na, ye mama manonItAstAnahaM jAnAmi, kintu mama bhakShyANi yo bhu Nkte matprANaprAtikUlyataH| utthApayati pAdasya mUlaM sa eSha mAnavaH|yadetad dharmmapustakasya vachanaM tadanusAreNAvashyaM ghaTiShyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>ahaM sa jana ityatra yathA yuShmAkaM vishvAso jAyate tadarthaM etAdR^ishaghaTanAt pUrvvam ahamidAnIM yuShmabhyamakathayam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatIva yathArthaM vadAmi, mayA preritaM janaM yo gR^ihlAti sa mAmeva gR^ihlAti yashcha mAM gR^ihlAti sa matprerakaM gR^ihlAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>etAM kathAM kathayitvA yIshu rduHkhI san pramANaM dattvA kathitavAn ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi yuShmAkam eko jano mAM parakareShu samarpayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH sa kamuddishya kathAmetAM kathitavAn ityatra sandigdhAH shiShyAH parasparaM mukhamAlokayituM prArabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmin samaye yIshu ryasmin aprIyata sa shiShyastasya vakShaHsthalam avAlambata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>shimonpitarastaM sa NketenAvadat, ayaM kamuddishya kathAmetAm kathayatIti pR^ichCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadA sa yIsho rvakShaHsthalam avalambya pR^iShThavAn, he prabho sa janaH kaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyavadad ekakhaNDaM pUpaM majjayitvA yasmai dAsyAmi saeva saH; pashchAt pUpakhaNDamekaM majjayitvA shimonaH putrAya IShkariyotIyAya yihUdai dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>tasmin datte sati shaitAn tamAshrayat; tadA yIshustam avadat tvaM yat kariShyasi tat kShipraM kuru|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>kintu sa yenAshayena tAM kathAmakathAyat tam upaviShTalokAnAM kopi nAbudhyata;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>kintu yihUdAH samIpe mudrAsampuTakasthiteH kechid ittham abudhyanta pArvvaNAsAdanArthaM kimapi dravyaM kretuM vA daridrebhyaH ki nchid vitarituM kathitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA pUpakhaNDagrahaNAt paraM sa tUrNaM bahiragachChat; rAtrishcha samupasyitA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>yihUde bahirgate yIshurakathayad idAnIM mAnavasutasya mahimA prakAshate teneshvarasyApi mahimA prakAshate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>yadi teneshvarasya mahimA prakAshate tarhIshvaropi svena tasya mahimAnaM prakAshayiShyati tUrNameva prakAshayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>he vatsA ahaM yuShmAbhiH sArddhaM ki nchitkAlamAtram Ase, tataH paraM mAM mR^igayiShyadhve kintvahaM yatsthAnaM yAmi tatsthAnaM yUyaM gantuM na shakShyatha, yAmimAM kathAM yihUdIyebhyaH kathitavAn tathAdhunA yuShmabhyamapi kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yUyaM parasparaM prIyadhvam ahaM yuShmAsu yathA prIye yUyamapi parasparam tathaiva prIyadhvaM, yuShmAn imAM navInAm Aj nAm AdishAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>tenaiva yadi parasparaM prIyadhve tarhi lakShaNenAnena yUyaM mama shiShyA iti sarvve j nAtuM shakShyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>shimonapitaraH pR^iShThavAn he prabho bhavAn kutra yAsyati? tato yIshuH pratyavadat, ahaM yatsthAnaM yAmi tatsthAnaM sAmprataM mama pashchAd gantuM na shaknoShi kintu pashchAd gamiShyasi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA pitaraH pratyuditavAn, he prabho sAmprataM kuto hetostava pashchAd gantuM na shaknomi? tvadarthaM prANAn dAtuM shaknomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyuktavAn mannimittaM kiM prANAn dAtuM shaknoShi? tvAmahaM yathArthaM vadAmi, kukkuTaravaNAt pUrvvaM tvaM tri rmAm apahnoShyase|</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>manoduHkhino mA bhUta; Ishvare vishvasita mayi cha vishvasita|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>mama pitu gR^ihe bahUni vAsasthAni santi no chet pUrvvaM yuShmAn aj nApayiShyaM yuShmadarthaM sthAnaM sajjayituM gachChAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yadi gatvAhaM yuShmannimittaM sthAnaM sajjayAmi tarhi panarAgatya yuShmAn svasamIpaM neShyAmi, tato yatrAhaM tiShThAmi tatra yUyamapi sthAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ahaM yatsthAnaM brajAmi tatsthAnaM yUyaM jAnItha tasya panthAnamapi jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA thomA avadat, he prabho bhavAn kutra yAti tadvayaM na jAnImaH, tarhi kathaM panthAnaM j nAtuM shaknumaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yIshurakathayad ahameva satyajIvanarUpapatho mayA na gantA kopi pituH samIpaM gantuM na shaknoti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yadi mAm aj nAsyata tarhi mama pitaramapyaj nAsyata kintvadhunAtastaM jAnItha pashyatha cha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA philipaH kathitavAn, he prabho pitaraM darshaya tasmAdasmAkaM yatheShTaM bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyAvAdIt, he philipa yuShmAbhiH sArddham etAvaddinAni sthitamapi mAM kiM na pratyabhijAnAsi? yo jano mAm apashyat sa pitaramapyapashyat tarhi pitaram asmAn darshayeti kathAM kathaM kathayasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ahaM pitari tiShThAmi pitA mayi tiShThatIti kiM tvaM na pratyaShi? ahaM yadvAkyaM vadAmi tat svato na vadAmi kintu yaH pitA mayi virAjate sa eva sarvvakarmmANi karAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ataeva pitaryyahaM tiShThAmi pitA cha mayi tiShThati mamAsyAM kathAyAM pratyayaM kuruta, no chet karmmahetoH pratyayaM kuruta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAnatiyathArthaM vadAmi, yo jano mayi vishvasiti sohamiva karmmANi kariShyati varaM tatopi mahAkarmmANi kariShyati yato hetorahaM pituH samIpaM gachChAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>yathA putreNa pitu rmahimA prakAshate tadarthaM mama nAma prochya yat prArthayiShyadhve tat saphalaM kariShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>yadi mama nAmnA yat ki nchid yAchadhve tarhi tadahaM sAdhayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>yadi mayi prIyadhve tarhi mamAj nAH samAcharata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tato mayA pituH samIpe prArthite pitA nirantaraM yuShmAbhiH sArddhaM sthAtum itaramekaM sahAyam arthAt satyamayam AtmAnaM yuShmAkaM nikaTaM preShayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>etajjagato lokAstaM grahItuM na shaknuvanti yataste taM nApashyan nAjanaMshcha kintu yUyaM jAnItha yato hetoH sa yuShmAkamanta rnivasati yuShmAkaM madhye sthAsyati cha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAn anAthAn kR^itvA na yAsyAmi punarapi yuShmAkaM samIpam AgamiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>kiyatkAlarat param asya jagato lokA mAM puna rna drakShyanti kintu yUyaM drakShyatha;ahaM jIviShyAmi tasmAt kAraNAd yUyamapi jIviShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>pitaryyahamasmi mayi cha yUyaM stha, tathAhaM yuShmAsvasmi tadapi tadA j nAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yo jano mamAj nA gR^ihItvA tA Acharati saeva mayi prIyate; yo janashcha mayi prIyate saeva mama pituH priyapAtraM bhaviShyati, tathAhamapi tasmin prItvA tasmai svaM prakAshayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadA IShkariyotIyAd anyo yihUdAstamavadat, he prabho bhavAn jagato lokAnAM sannidhau prakAshito na bhUtvAsmAkaM sannidhau kutaH prakAshito bhaviShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyuditavAn, yo jano mayi prIyate sa mamAj nA api gR^ihlAti, tena mama pitApi tasmin preShyate, AvA ncha tannikaTamAgatya tena saha nivatsyAvaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yo jano mayi na prIyate sa mama kathA api na gR^ihlAti punashcha yAmimAM kathAM yUyaM shR^iNutha sA kathA kevalasya mama na kintu mama prerako yaH pitA tasyApi kathA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>idAnIM yuShmAkaM nikaTe vidyamAnoham etAH sakalAH kathAH kathayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintvitaH paraM pitrA yaH sahAyo.arthAt pavitra AtmA mama nAmni prerayiShyati sa sarvvaM shikShayitvA mayoktAH samastAH kathA yuShmAn smArayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAkaM nikaTe shAntiM sthApayitvA yAmi, nijAM shAntiM yuShmabhyaM dadAmi, jagato lokA yathA dadAti tathAhaM na dadAmi; yuShmAkam antaHkaraNAni duHkhitAni bhItAni cha na bhavantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>ahaM gatvA punarapi yuShmAkaM samIpam AgamiShyAmi mayoktaM vAkyamidaM yUyam ashrauShTa; yadi mayyapreShyadhvaM tarhyahaM pituH samIpaM gachChAmi mamAsyAM kathAyAM yUyam ahlAdiShyadhvaM yato mama pitA mattopi mahAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tasyA ghaTanAyAH samaye yathA yuShmAkaM shraddhA jAyate tadartham ahaM tasyA ghaTanAyAH pUrvvam idAnIM yuShmAn etAM vArttAM vadAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>itaH paraM yuShmAbhiH saha mama bahava AlApA na bhaviShyanti yataH kAraNAd etasya jagataH patirAgachChati kintu mayA saha tasya kopi sambandho nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>ahaM pitari prema karomi tathA pitu rvidhivat karmmANi karomIti yena jagato lokA jAnanti tadartham uttiShThata vayaM sthAnAdasmAd gachChAma|</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>ahaM satyadrAkShAlatAsvarUpo mama pitA tUdyAnaparichArakasvarUpa ncha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>mama yAsu shAkhAsu phalAni na bhavanti tAH sa Chinatti tathA phalavatyaH shAkhA yathAdhikaphalAni phalanti tadarthaM tAH pariShkaroti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>idAnIM mayoktopadeshena yUyaM pariShkR^itAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ataH kAraNAt mayi tiShThata tenAhamapi yuShmAsu tiShThAmi, yato heto rdrAkShAlatAyAm asaMlagnA shAkhA yathA phalavatI bhavituM na shaknoti tathA yUyamapi mayyatiShThantaH phalavanto bhavituM na shaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ahaM drAkShAlatAsvarUpo yUya ncha shAkhAsvarUpoH; yo jano mayi tiShThati yatra chAhaM tiShThAmi, sa prachUraphalaiH phalavAn bhavati, kintu mAM vinA yUyaM kimapi karttuM na shaknutha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>yaH kashchin mayi na tiShThati sa shuShkashAkheva bahi rnikShipyate lokAshcha tA AhR^itya vahnau nikShipya dAhayanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM mayi tiShThatha mama kathA cha yuShmAsu tiShThati tarhi yad vA nChitvA yAchiShyadhve yuShmAkaM tadeva saphalaM bhaviShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM prachUraphalavanto bhavatha tarhi tadvArA mama pitu rmahimA prakAshiShyate tathA yUyaM mama shiShyA iti parikShAyiShyadhve|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>pitA yathA mayi prItavAn ahamapi yuShmAsu tathA prItavAn ato heto ryUyaM nirantaraM mama premapAtrANi bhUtvA tiShThata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ahaM yathA piturAj nA gR^ihItvA tasya premabhAjanaM tiShThAmi tathaiva yUyamapi yadi mamAj nA guhlItha tarhi mama premabhAjanAni sthAsyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>yuShmannimittaM mama ya AhlAdaH sa yathA chiraM tiShThati yuShmAkam Anandashcha yathA pUryyate tadarthaM yuShmabhyam etAH kathA atrakatham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>ahaM yuShmAsu yathA prIye yUyamapi parasparaM tathA prIyadhvam eShA mamAj nA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>mitrANAM kAraNAt svaprANadAnaparyyantaM yat prema tasmAn mahAprema kasyApi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ahaM yadyad AdishAmi tattadeva yadi yUyam Acharata tarhi yUyameva mama mitrANi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>adyArabhya yuShmAn dAsAn na vadiShyAmi yat prabhu ryat karoti dAsastad na jAnAti; kintu pituH samIpe yadyad ashR^iNavaM tat sarvvaM yUShmAn aj nApayam tatkAraNAd yuShmAn mitrANi proktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>yUyaM mAM rochitavanta iti na, kintvahameva yuShmAn rochitavAn yUyaM gatvA yathA phalAnyutpAdayatha tAni phalAni chAkShayANi bhavanti, tadarthaM yuShmAn nyajunajaM tasmAn mama nAma prochya pitaraM yat ki nchid yAchiShyadhve tadeva sa yuShmabhyaM dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>yUyaM parasparaM prIyadhvam aham ityAj nApayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>jagato lokai ryuShmAsu R^itIyiteShu te pUrvvaM mAmevArttIyanta iti yUyaM jAnItha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>yadi yUyaM jagato lokA abhaviShyata tarhi jagato lokA yuShmAn AtmIyAn buddhvApreShyanta; kintu yUyaM jagato lokA na bhavatha, ahaM yuShmAn asmAjjagato.arochayam etasmAt kAraNAjjagato lokA yuShmAn R^itIyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>dAsaH prabho rmahAn na bhavati mamaitat pUrvvIyaM vAkyaM smarata; te yadi mAmevAtADayan tarhi yuShmAnapi tADayiShyanti, yadi mama vAkyaM gR^ihlanti tarhi yuShmAkamapi vAkyaM grahIShyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>kintu te mama nAmakAraNAd yuShmAn prati tAdR^ishaM vyavahariShyanti yato yo mAM preritavAn taM te na jAnanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>teShAM sannidhim Agatya yadyahaM nAkathayiShyaM tarhi teShAM pApaM nAbhaviShyat kintvadhunA teShAM pApamAchChAdayitum upAyo nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yo jano mAm R^itIyate sa mama pitaramapi R^itIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yAdR^ishAni karmmANi kenApi kadApi nAkriyanta tAdR^ishAni karmmANi yadi teShAM sAkShAd ahaM nAkariShyaM tarhi teShAM pApaM nAbhaviShyat kintvadhunA te dR^iShTvApi mAM mama pitara nchArttIyanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tasmAt te.akAraNaM mAm R^itIyante yadetad vachanaM teShAM shAstre likhitamAste tat saphalam abhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>kintu pitu rnirgataM yaM sahAyamarthAt satyamayam AtmAnaM pituH samIpAd yuShmAkaM samIpe preShayiShyAmi sa Agatya mayi pramANaM dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>yUyaM prathamamArabhya mayA sArddhaM tiShThatha tasmAddheto ryUyamapi pramANaM dAsyatha|</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>yuShmAkaM yathA vAdhA na jAyate tadarthaM yuShmAn etAni sarvvavAkyAni vyAharaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>lokA yuShmAn bhajanagR^ihebhyo dUrIkariShyanti tathA yasmin samaye yuShmAn hatvA Ishvarasya tuShTi janakaM karmmAkurmma iti maMsyante sa samaya AgachChanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>te pitaraM mA ncha na jAnanti, tasmAd yuShmAn pratIdR^isham AchariShyanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ato hetAH samaye samupasthite yathA mama kathA yuShmAkaM manaHsuH samupatiShThati tadarthaM yuShmAbhyam etAM kathAM kathayAmi yuShmAbhiH sArddham ahaM tiShThan prathamaM tAM yuShmabhyaM nAkathayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>sAmprataM svasya prerayituH samIpaM gachChAmi tathApi tvaM kka gachChasi kathAmetAM yuShmAkaM kopi mAM na pR^ichChati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>kintu mayoktAbhirAbhiH kathAbhi ryUShmAkam antaHkaraNAni duHkhena pUrNAnyabhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tathApyahaM yathArthaM kathayAmi mama gamanaM yuShmAkaM hitArthameva, yato heto rgamane na kR^ite sahAyo yuShmAkaM samIpaM nAgamiShyati kintu yadi gachChAmi tarhi yuShmAkaM samIpe taM preShayiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH sa Agatya pApapuNyadaNDeShu jagato lokAnAM prabodhaM janayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>te mayi na vishvasanti tasmAddhetoH pApaprabodhaM janayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>yuShmAkam adR^ishyaH sannahaM pituH samIpaM gachChAmi tasmAd puNye prabodhaM janayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>etajjagato.adhipati rdaNDAj nAM prApnoti tasmAd daNDe prabodhaM janayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yuShmabhyaM kathayituM mamAnekAH kathA Asate, tAH kathA idAnIM yUyaM soDhuM na shaknutha;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintu satyamaya AtmA yadA samAgamiShyati tadA sarvvaM satyaM yuShmAn neShyati, sa svataH kimapi na vadiShyati kintu yachChroShyati tadeva kathayitvA bhAvikAryyaM yuShmAn j nApayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>mama mahimAnaM prakAshayiShyati yato madIyAM kathAM gR^ihItvA yuShmAn bodhayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>pitu ryadyad Aste tat sarvvaM mama tasmAd kAraNAd avAdiShaM sa madIyAM kathAM gR^ihItvA yuShmAn bodhayiShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kiyatkAlAt paraM yUyaM mAM draShTuM na lapsyadhve kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM puna rdraShTuM lapsyadhve yatohaM pituH samIpaM gachChAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataH shiShyANAM kiyanto janAH parasparaM vaditum Arabhanta, kiyatkAlAt paraM mAM draShTuM na lapsyadhve kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM puna rdraShTuM lapsyadhve yatohaM pituH samIpaM gachChAmi, iti yad vAkyam ayaM vadati tat kiM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH kiyatkAlAt param iti tasya vAkyaM kiM? tasya vAkyasyAbhiprAyaM vayaM boddhuM na shaknumastairiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>nigadite yIshusteShAM prashnechChAM j nAtvA tebhyo.akathayat kiyatkAlAt paraM mAM draShTuM na lapsyadhve, kintu kiyatkAlAt paraM pUna rdraShTuM lapsyadhve, yAmimAM kathAmakathayaM tasyA abhiprAyaM kiM yUyaM parasparaM mR^igayadhve?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yuShmAnaham atiyathArthaM vadAmi yUyaM krandiShyatha vilapiShyatha cha, kintu jagato lokA AnandiShyanti; yUyaM shokAkulA bhaviShyatha kintu shokAt paraM AnandayuktA bhaviShyatha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>prasavakAla upasthite nArI yathA prasavavedanayA vyAkulA bhavati kintu putre bhUmiShThe sati manuShyaiko janmanA naraloke praviShTa ityAnandAt tasyAstatsarvvaM duHkhaM manasi na tiShThati,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tathA yUyamapi sAmprataM shokAkulA bhavatha kintu punarapi yuShmabhyaM darshanaM dAsyAmi tena yuShmAkam antaHkaraNAni sAnandAni bhaviShyanti, yuShmAkaM tam Ananda ncha kopi harttuM na shakShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmin divase kAmapi kathAM mAM na prakShyatha| yuShmAnaham atiyathArthaM vadAmi, mama nAmnA yat ki nchid pitaraM yAchiShyadhve tadeva sa dAsyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>pUrvve mama nAmnA kimapi nAyAchadhvaM, yAchadhvaM tataH prApsyatha tasmAd yuShmAkaM sampUrNAnando janiShyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>upamAkathAbhiH sarvvANyetAni yuShmAn j nApitavAn kintu yasmin samaye upamayA noktvA pituH kathAM spaShTaM j nApayiShyAmi samaya etAdR^isha AgachChati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA mama nAmnA prArthayiShyadhve .ahaM yuShmannimittaM pitaraM vineShye kathAmimAM na vadAmi;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>yato yUyaM mayi prema kurutha, tathAham Ishvarasya samIpAd AgatavAn ityapi pratItha, tasmAd kAraNAt kAraNAt pitA svayaM yuShmAsu prIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>pituH samIpAjjajad Agatosmi jagat parityajya cha punarapi pituH samIpaM gachChAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tadA shiShyA avadan, he prabho bhavAn upamayA noktvAdhunA spaShTaM vadati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>bhavAn sarvvaj naH kenachit pR^iShTo bhavitumapi bhavataH prayojanaM nAstItyadhunAsmAkaM sthiraj nAnaM jAtaM tasmAd bhavAn Ishvarasya samIpAd AgatavAn ityatra vayaM vishvasimaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratyavAdId idAnIM kiM yUyaM vishvasitha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>pashyata sarvve yUyaM vikIrNAH santo mAm ekAkinaM pIratyajya svaM svaM sthAnaM gamiShyatha, etAdR^ishaH samaya AgachChati varaM prAyeNopasthitavAn; tathApyahaM naikAkI bhavAmi yataH pitA mayA sArddham Aste|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>yathA mayA yuShmAkaM shAnti rjAyate tadartham etAH kathA yuShmabhyam achakathaM; asmin jagati yuShmAkaM klesho ghaTiShyate kintvakShobhA bhavata yato mayA jagajjitaM|</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshuretAH kathAH kathayitvA svargaM vilokyaitat prArthayat, he pitaH samaya upasthitavAn; yathA tava putrastava mahimAnaM prakAshayati tadarthaM tvaM nijaputrasya mahimAnaM prakAshaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>tvaM yollokAn tasya haste samarpitavAn sa yathA tebhyo.anantAyu rdadAti tadarthaM tvaM prANimAtrANAm adhipatitvabhAraM tasmai dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>yastvam advitIyaH satya IshvarastvayA preritashcha yIshuH khrIShTa etayorubhayoH parichaye prApte.anantAyu rbhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tvaM yasya karmmaNo bhAraM mahyaM dattavAn, tat sampannaM kR^itvA jagatyasmin tava mahimAnaM prAkAshayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>ataeva he pita rjagatyavidyamAne tvayA saha tiShThato mama yo mahimAsIt samprati tava samIpe mAM taM mahimAnaM prApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>anyachcha tvam etajjagato yAllokAn mahyam adadA ahaM tebhyastava nAmnastattvaj nAnam adadAM, te tavaivAsan, tvaM tAn mahyamadadAH, tasmAtte tavopadesham agR^ihlan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tvaM mahyaM yat ki nchid adadAstatsarvvaM tvatto jAyate ityadhunAjAnan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>mahyaM yamupadesham adadA ahamapi tebhyastamupadesham adadAM tepi tamagR^ihlan tvattohaM nirgatya tvayA preritobhavam atra cha vyashvasan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>teShAmeva nimittaM prArthaye.ahaM jagato lokanimittaM na prArthaye kintu yAllokAn mahyam adadAsteShAmeva nimittaM prArthaye.ahaM yataste tavaivAsate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>ye mama te tava ye cha tava te mama tathA tai rmama mahimA prakAshyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>sAmpratam asmin jagati mamAvasthiteH sheSham abhavat ahaM tava samIpaM gachChAmi kintu te jagati sthAsyanti; he pavitra pitarAvayo ryathaikatvamAste tathA teShAmapyekatvaM bhavati tadarthaM yAllokAn mahyam adadAstAn svanAmnA rakSha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yAvanti dinAni jagatyasmin taiH sahAhamAsaM tAvanti dinAni tAn tava nAmnAhaM rakShitavAn; yAllokAn mahyam adadAstAn sarvvAn ahamarakShaM, teShAM madhye kevalaM vinAshapAtraM hAritaM tena dharmmapustakasya vachanaM pratyakShaM bhavati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>kintvadhunA tava sannidhiM gachChAmi mayA yathA teShAM sampUrNAnando bhavati tadarthamahaM jagati tiShThan etAH kathA akathayam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>tavopadeshaM tebhyo.adadAM jagatA saha yathA mama sambandho nAsti tathA jajatA saha teShAmapi sambandhAbhAvAj jagato lokAstAn R^itIyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tvaM jagatastAn gR^ihANeti na prArthaye kintvashubhAd rakSheti prArthayeham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>ahaM yathA jagatsambandhIyo na bhavAmi tathA tepi jagatsambandhIyA na bhavanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tava satyakathayA tAn pavitrIkuru tava vAkyameva satyaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tvaM yathA mAM jagati prairayastathAhamapi tAn jagati prairayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>teShAM hitArthaM yathAhaM svaM pavitrIkaromi tathA satyakathayA tepi pavitrIbhavantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>kevalaM eteShAmarthe prArthaye.aham iti na kintveteShAmupadeshena ye janA mayi vishvasiShyanti teShAmapyarthe prArtheye.aham|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>he pitasteShAM sarvveShAm ekatvaM bhavatu tava yathA mayi mama cha yathA tvayyekatvaM tathA teShAmapyAvayorekatvaM bhavatu tena tvaM mAM preritavAn iti jagato lokAH pratiyantu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>yathAvayorekatvaM tathA teShAmapyekatvaM bhavatu teShvahaM mayi cha tvam itthaM teShAM sampUrNamekatvaM bhavatu, tvaM preritavAn tvaM mayi yathA prIyase cha tathA teShvapi prItavAn etadyathA jagato lokA jAnanti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tadarthaM tvaM yaM mahimAnaM mahyam adadAstaM mahimAnam ahamapi tebhyo dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>he pita rjagato nirmmANAt pUrvvaM mayi snehaM kR^itvA yaM mahimAnaM dattavAn mama taM mahimAnaM yathA te pashyanti tadarthaM yAllokAn mahyaM dattavAn ahaM yatra tiShThAmi tepi yathA tatra tiShThanti mamaiShA vA nChA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>he yathArthika pita rjagato lokaistvayyaj nAtepi tvAmahaM jAne tvaM mAM preritavAn itIme shiShyA jAnanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>yathAhaM teShu tiShThAmi tathA mayi yena premnA premAkarostat teShu tiShThati tadarthaM tava nAmAhaM tAn j nApitavAn punarapi j nApayiShyAmi|</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tAH kathAH kathayitvA yIshuH shiShyAnAdAya kidronnAmakaM srota uttIryya shiShyaiH saha tatratyodyAnaM prAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>kintu vishvAsaghAtiyihUdAstat sthAnaM parichIyate yato yIshuH shiShyaiH sArddhaM kadAchit tat sthAnam agachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tadA sa yihUdAH sainyagaNaM pradhAnayAjakAnAM phirUshinA ncha padAtigaNa ncha gR^ihItvA pradIpAn ulkAn astrANi chAdAya tasmin sthAna upasthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>svaM prati yad ghaTiShyate taj j nAtvA yIshuragresaraH san tAnapR^ichChat kaM gaveShayatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>te pratyavadan, nAsaratIyaM yIshuM; tato yIshuravAdId ahameva saH; taiH saha vishvAsaghAtI yihUdAshchAtiShThat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadAhameva sa tasyaitAM kathAM shrutvaiva te pashchAdetya bhUmau patitAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tato yIshuH punarapi pR^iShThavAn kaM gaveShayatha? tataste pratyavadan nAsaratIyaM yIshuM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyuditavAn ahameva sa imAM kathAmachakatham; yadi mAmanvichChatha tarhImAn gantuM mA vArayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>itthaM bhUte mahyaM yAllokAn adadAsteShAm ekamapi nAhArayam imAM yAM kathAM sa svayamakathayat sA kathA saphalA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tadA shimonpitarasya nikaTe kha NgalsthiteH sa taM niShkoShaM kR^itvA mahAyAjakasya mAlkhanAmAnaM dAsam Ahatya tasya dakShiNakarNaM ChinnavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pitaram avadat, kha NgaM koShe sthApaya mama pitA mahyaM pAtuM yaM kaMsam adadAt tenAhaM kiM na pAsyAmi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadA sainyagaNaH senApati ryihUdIyAnAM padAtayashcha yIshuM ghR^itvA baddhvA hAnannAmnaH kiyaphAH shvashurasya samIpaM prathamam anayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>sa kiyaphAstasmin vatsare mahAyAjatvapade niyuktaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>san sAdhAraNalokAnAM ma NgalArtham ekajanasya maraNamuchitam iti yihUdIyaiH sArddham amantrayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA shimonpitaro.anyaikashiShyashcha yIshoH pashchAd agachChatAM tasyAnyashiShyasya mahAyAjakena parichitatvAt sa yIshunA saha mahAyAjakasyATTAlikAM prAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>kintu pitaro bahirdvArasya samIpe.atiShThad ataeva mahAyAjakena parichitaH sa shiShyaH punarbahirgatvA dauvAyikAyai kathayitvA pitaram abhyantaram Anayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadA sa dvArarakShikA pitaram avadat tvaM kiM na tasya mAnavasya shiShyaH? tataH sovadad ahaM na bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataH paraM yatsthAne dAsAH padAtayashcha shItahetora NgArai rvahniM prajvAlya tApaM sevitavantastatsthAne pitarastiShThan taiH saha vahnitApaM sevitum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tadA shiShyeShUpadeshe cha mahAyAjakena yIshuH pR^iShTaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>san pratyuktavAn sarvvalokAnAM samakShaM kathAmakathayaM guptaM kAmapi kathAM na kathayitvA yat sthAnaM yihUdIyAH satataM gachChanti tatra bhajanagehe mandire chAshikShayaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>mattaH kutaH pR^ichChasi? ye janA madupadesham ashR^iNvan tAneva pR^ichCha yadyad avadaM te tat jAninta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tadetthaM pratyuditatvAt nikaTasthapadAti ryIshuM chapeTenAhatya vyAharat mahAyAjakam evaM prativadasi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tato yIshuH pratigaditavAn yadyayathArtham achakathaM tarhi tasyAyathArthasya pramANaM dehi, kintu yadi yathArthaM tarhi kuto heto rmAm atADayaH?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>pUrvvaM hAnan sabandhanaM taM kiyaphAmahAyAjakasya samIpaM praiShayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>shimonpitarastiShThan vahnitApaM sevate, etasmin samaye kiyantastam apR^ichChan tvaM kim etasya janasya shiShyo na? tataH sopahnutyAbravId ahaM na bhavAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tadA mahAyAjakasya yasya dAsasya pitaraH karNamachChinat tasya kuTumbaH pratyuditavAn udyAne tena saha tiShThantaM tvAM kiM nApashyaM?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>kintu pitaraH punarapahnutya kathitavAn; tadAnIM kukkuTo.araut|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadanantaraM pratyUShe te kiyaphAgR^ihAd adhipate rgR^ihaM yIshum anayan kintu yasmin ashuchitve jAte tai rnistArotsave na bhoktavyaM, tasya bhayAd yihUdIyAstadgR^ihaM nAvishan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>aparaM pIlAto bahirAgatya tAn pR^iShThavAn etasya manuShyasya kaM doShaM vadatha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA te petyavadan duShkarmmakAriNi na sati bhavataH samIpe nainaM samArpayiShyAmaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tataH pIlAto.avadad yUyamenaM gR^ihItvA sveShAM vyavasthayA vichArayata| tadA yihUdIyAH pratyavadan kasyApi manuShyasya prANadaNDaM karttuM nAsmAkam adhikAro.asti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>evaM sati yIshuH svasya mR^ityau yAM kathAM kathitavAn sA saphalAbhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>tadanantaraM pIlAtaH punarapi tad rAjagR^ihaM gatvA yIshumAhUya pR^iShTavAn tvaM kiM yihUdIyAnAM rAjA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyavadat tvam etAM kathAM svataH kathayasi kimanyaH kashchin mayi kathitavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>pIlAto.avadad ahaM kiM yihUdIyaH? tava svadeshIyA visheShataH pradhAnayAjakA mama nikaTe tvAM samArpayana, tvaM kiM kR^itavAn?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>yIshuH pratyavadat mama rAjyam etajjagatsambandhIyaM na bhavati yadi mama rAjyaM jagatsambandhIyam abhaviShyat tarhi yihUdIyAnAM hasteShu yathA samarpito nAbhavaM tadarthaM mama sevakA ayotsyan kintu mama rAjyam aihikaM na|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtaH kathitavAn, tarhi tvaM rAjA bhavasi? yIshuH pratyuktavAn tvaM satyaM kathayasi, rAjAhaM bhavAmi; satyatAyAM sAkShyaM dAtuM janiM gR^ihItvA jagatyasmin avatIrNavAn, tasmAt satyadharmmapakShapAtino mama kathAM shR^iNvanti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>tadA satyaM kiM? etAM kathAM paShTvA pIlAtaH punarapi bahirgatvA yihUdIyAn abhAShata, ahaM tasya kamapyaparAdhaM na prApnomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>nistArotsavasamaye yuShmAbhirabhiruchita eko jano mayA mochayitavya eShA yuShmAkaM rItirasti, ataeva yuShmAkaM nikaTe yihUdIyAnAM rAjAnaM kiM mochayAmi, yuShmAkam ichChA kA?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tadA te sarvve ruvanto vyAharan enaM mAnuShaM nahi barabbAM mochaya| kintu sa barabbA dasyurAsIt|</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>pIlAto yIshum AnIya kashayA prAhArayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pashchAt senAgaNaH kaNTakanirmmitaM mukuTaM tasya mastake samarpya vArttAkIvarNaM rAjaparichChadaM paridhApya,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>he yihUdIyAnAM rAjan namaskAra ityuktvA taM chapeTenAhantum Arabhata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>tadA pIlAtaH punarapi bahirgatvA lokAn avadat, asya kamapyaparAdhaM na labhe.ahaM, pashyata tad yuShmAn j nApayituM yuShmAkaM sannidhau bahirenam AnayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshuH kaNTakamukuTavAn vArttAkIvarNavasanavAMshcha bahirAgachChat| tataH pIlAta uktavAn enaM manuShyaM pashyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA pradhAnayAjakAH padAtayashcha taM dR^iShTvA, enaM krushe vidha, enaM krushe vidha, ityuktvA ravituM Arabhanta| tataH pIlAtaH kathitavAn yUyaM svayam enaM nItvA krushe vidhata, aham etasya kamapyaparAdhaM na prAptavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>yihUdIyAH pratyavadan asmAkaM yA vyavasthAste tadanusAreNAsya prANahananam uchitaM yatoyaM svam Ishvarasya putramavadat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>pIlAta imAM kathAM shrutvA mahAtrAsayuktaH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>san punarapi rAjagR^iha Agatya yIshuM pR^iShTavAn tvaM kutratyo lokaH? kintu yIshastasya kimapi pratyuttaraM nAvadat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>1# tataH pIlAt kathitavAna tvaM kiM mayA sArddhaM na saMlapiShyasi ? tvAM krushe vedhituM vA mochayituM shakti rmamAste iti kiM tvaM na jAnAsi ? tadA yIshuH pratyavadad IshvareNAdaŸाM mamopari tava kimapyadhipatitvaM na vidyate, tathApi yo jano mAM tava haste samArpayat tasya mahApAtakaM jAtam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tadA yIshuH pratyavadad IshvareNAdattaM mamopari tava kimapyadhipatitvaM na vidyate, tathApi yo jano mAM tava haste samArpayat tasya mahApAtakaM jAtam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>tadArabhya pIlAtastaM mochayituM cheShTitavAn kintu yihUdIyA ruvanto vyAharan yadImaM mAnavaM tyajasi tarhi tvaM kaisarasya mitraM na bhavasi, yo janaH svaM rAjAnaM vakti saeva kaimarasya viruddhAM kathAM kathayati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>etAM kathAM shrutvA pIlAto yIshuM bahirAnIya nistArotsavasya AsAdanadinasya dvitIyapraharAt pUrvvaM prastarabandhananAmni sthAne .arthAt ibrIyabhAShayA yad gabbithA kathyate tasmin sthAne vichArAsana upAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>anantaraM pIlAto yihUdIyAn avadat, yuShmAkaM rAjAnaM pashyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>kintu enaM dUrIkuru, enaM dUrIkuru, enaM krushe vidha, iti kathAM kathayitvA te ravitum Arabhanta; tadA pIlAtaH kathitavAn yuShmAkaM rAjAnaM kiM krushe vedhiShyAmi? pradhAnayAjakA uttaram avadan kaisaraM vinA kopi rAjAsmAkaM nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataH pIlAto yIshuM krushe vedhituM teShAM hasteShu samArpayat, tataste taM dhR^itvA nItavantaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tataH paraM yIshuH krushaM vahan shiraHkapAlam arthAd yad ibrIyabhAShayA gulgaltAM vadanti tasmin sthAna upasthitaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tataste madhyasthAne taM tasyobhayapArshve dvAvaparau krushe.avidhan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>aparam eSha yihUdIyAnAM rAjA nAsaratIyayIshuH, iti vij nApanaM likhitvA pIlAtastasya krushopari samayojayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>sA lipiH ibrIyayUnAnIyaromIyabhAShAbhi rlikhitA; yIshoH krushavedhanasthAnaM nagarasya samIpaM, tasmAd bahavo yihUdIyAstAM paThitum Arabhanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAM pradhAnayAjakAH pIlAtamiti nyavedayan yihUdIyAnAM rAjeti vAkyaM na kintu eSha svaM yihUdIyAnAM rAjAnam avadad itthaM likhatu|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>tataH pIlAta uttaraM dattavAn yallekhanIyaM tallikhitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>itthaM senAgaNo yIshuM krushe vidhitvA tasya paridheyavastraM chaturo bhAgAn kR^itvA ekaikasenA ekaikabhAgam agR^ihlat tasyottarIyavastra nchAgR^ihlat| kintUttarIyavastraM sUchisevanaM vinA sarvvam UtaM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>tasmAtte vyAharan etat kaH prApsyati? tanna khaNDayitvA tatra guTikApAtaM karavAma| vibhajante.adharIyaM me vasanaM te parasparaM| mamottarIyavastrArthaM guTikAM pAtayanti cha| iti yadvAkyaM dharmmapustake likhitamAste tat senAgaNenetthaM vyavaharaNAt siddhamabhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>tadAnIM yIsho rmAtA mAtu rbhaginI cha yA kliyapA bhAryyA mariyam magdalInI mariyam cha etAstasya krushasya sannidhau samatiShThan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>tato yIshuH svamAtaraM priyatamashiShya ncha samIpe daNDAyamAnau vilokya mAtaram avadat, he yoShid enaM tava putraM pashya,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>shiShyantvavadat, enAM tava mAtaraM pashya| tataH sa shiShyastadghaTikAyAM tAM nijagR^ihaM nItavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>anantaraM sarvvaM karmmAdhunA sampannamabhUt yIshuriti j nAtvA dharmmapustakasya vachanaM yathA siddhaM bhavati tadartham akathayat mama pipAsA jAtA|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>tatastasmin sthAne amlarasena pUrNapAtrasthityA te spa njamekaM tadamlarasenArdrIkR^itya esobnale tad yojayitvA tasya mukhasya sannidhAvasthApayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>tadA yIshuramlarasaM gR^ihItvA sarvvaM siddham iti kathAM kathayitvA mastakaM namayan prANAn paryyatyajat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>tadvinam AsAdanadinaM tasmAt pare.ahani vishrAmavAre dehA yathA krushopari na tiShThanti, yataH sa vishrAmavAro mahAdinamAsIt, tasmAd yihUdIyAH pIlAtanikaTaM gatvA teShAM pAdabha njanasya sthAnAntaranayanasya chAnumatiM prArthayanta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>ataH senA Agatya yIshunA saha krushe hatayoH prathamadvitIyachorayoH pAdAn abha njan;</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>kintu yIshoH sannidhiM gatvA sa mR^ita iti dR^iShTvA tasya pAdau nAbha njan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>pashchAd eko yoddhA shUlAghAtena tasya kukShim avidhat tatkShaNAt tasmAd raktaM jala ncha niragachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>yo jano.asya sAkShyaM dadAti sa svayaM dR^iShTavAn tasyedaM sAkShyaM satyaM tasya kathA yuShmAkaM vishvAsaM janayituM yogyA tat sa jAnAti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>tasyaikam asdhyapi na bhaMkShyate,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>tadvad anyashAstrepi likhyate, yathA, "dR^iShTipAtaM kariShyanti te.avidhan yantu tamprati|"</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>arimathIyanagarasya yUShaphnAmA shiShya eka AsIt kintu yihUdIyebhyo bhayAt prakAshito na bhavati; sa yIsho rdehaM netuM pIlAtasyAnumatiM prArthayata, tataH pIlAtenAnumate sati sa gatvA yIsho rdeham anayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>aparaM yo nikadImo rAtrau yIshoH samIpam agachChat sopi gandharasena mishritaM prAyeNa pa nchAshatseTakamaguruM gR^ihItvAgachChat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>tataste yihUdIyAnAM shmashAne sthApanarItyanusAreNa tatsugandhidravyeNa sahitaM tasya dehaM vastreNAveShTayan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>apara ncha yatra sthAne taM krushe.avidhan tasya nikaTasthodyAne yatra kimapi mR^itadehaM kadApi nAsthApyata tAdR^isham ekaM nUtanaM shmashAnam AsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>yihUdIyAnAm AsAdanadinAgamanAt te tasmin samIpasthashmashAne yIshum ashAyayan|</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>anantaraM saptAhasya prathamadine .atipratyUShe .andhakAre tiShThati magdalInI mariyam tasya shmashAnasya nikaTaM gatvA shmashAnasya mukhAt prastaramapasAritam apashyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>pashchAd dhAvitvA shimonpitarAya yIshoH priyatamashiShyAya chedam akathayat, lokAH shmashAnAt prabhuM nItvA kutrAsthApayan tad vaktuM na shaknomi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>ataH pitaraH sonyashiShyashcha barhi rbhutvA shmashAnasthAnaM gantum ArabhetAM|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>ubhayordhAvatoH sonyashiShyaH pitaraM pashchAt tyaktvA pUrvvaM shmashAnasthAna upasthitavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA prahvIbhUya sthApitavastrANi dR^iShTavAn kintu na prAvishat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>aparaM shimonpitara Agatya shmashAnasthAnaM pravishya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>sthApitavastrANi mastakasya vastra ncha pR^ithak sthAnAntare sthApitaM dR^iShTavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>tataH shmashAnasthAnaM pUrvvam Agato yonyashiShyaH sopi pravishya tAdR^ishaM dR^iShTA vyashvasIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>yataH shmashAnAt sa utthApayitavya etasya dharmmapustakavachanasya bhAvaM te tadA voddhuM nAshankuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>anantaraM tau dvau shiShyau svaM svaM gR^ihaM parAvR^ityAgachChatAm|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>tataH paraM mariyam shmashAnadvArasya bahiH sthitvA roditum Arabhata tato rudatI prahvIbhUya shmashAnaM vilokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>yIshoH shayanasthAnasya shiraHsthAne padatale cha dvayo rdisho dvau svargIyadUtAvupaviShTau samapashyat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tau pR^iShTavantau he nAri kuto rodiShi? sAvadat lokA mama prabhuM nItvA kutrAsthApayan iti na jAnAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>ityuktvA mukhaM parAvR^itya yIshuM daNDAyamAnam apashyat kintu sa yIshuriti sA j nAtuM nAshaknot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAm apR^ichChat he nAri kuto rodiShi? kaM vA mR^igayase? tataH sA tam udyAnasevakaM j nAtvA vyAharat, he mahechCha tvaM yadItaH sthAnAt taM nItavAn tarhi kutrAsthApayastad vada tatsthAnAt tam AnayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tadA yIshustAm avadat he mariyam| tataH sA parAvR^itya pratyavadat he rabbUnI arthAt he guro|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>tadA yIshuravadat mAM mA dhara, idAnIM pituH samIpe UrddhvagamanaM na karomi kintu yo mama yuShmAka ncha pitA mama yuShmAka ncheshvarastasya nikaTa UrddhvagamanaM karttum udyatosmi, imAM kathAM tvaM gatvA mama bhrAtR^igaNaM j nApaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>tato magdalInImariyam tatkShaNAd gatvA prabhustasyai darshanaM dattvA kathA etA akathayad iti vArttAM shiShyebhyo.akathayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>tataH paraM saptAhasya prathamadinasya sandhyAsamaye shiShyA ekatra militvA yihUdIyebhyo bhiyA dvAraruddham akurvvan, etasmin kAle yIshusteShAM madhyasthAne tiShThan akathayad yuShmAkaM kalyANaM bhUyAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>ityuktvA nijahastaM kukShi ncha darshitavAn, tataH shiShyAH prabhuM dR^iShTvA hR^iShTA abhavan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>yIshuH punaravadad yuShmAkaM kalyANaM bhUyAt pitA yathA mAM praiShayat tathAhamapi yuShmAn preShayAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>ityuktvA sa teShAmupari dIrghaprashvAsaM dattvA kathitavAn pavitram AtmAnaM gR^ihlIta|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>yUyaM yeShAM pApAni mochayiShyatha te mochayiShyante yeShA ncha pApAti na mochayiShyatha te na mochayiShyante|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>dvAdashamadhye gaNito yamajo thomAnAmA shiShyo yIshorAgamanakAlai taiH sArddhaM nAsIt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>ato vayaM prabhUm apashyAmeti vAkye.anyashiShyairukte sovadat, tasya hastayo rlauhakIlakAnAM chihnaM na vilokya tachchihnam a NgulyA na spR^iShTvA tasya kukShau hastaM nAropya chAhaM na vishvasiShyAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>aparam aShTame.ahni gate sati thomAsahitaH shiShyagaNa ekatra militvA dvAraM ruddhvAbhyantara AsIt, etarhi yIshusteShAM madhyasthAne tiShThan akathayat, yuShmAkaM kushalaM bhUyAt|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>pashchAt thAmai kathitavAn tvam a NgulIm atrArpayitvA mama karau pashya karaM prasAryya mama kukShAvarpaya nAvishvasya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>tadA thomA avadat, he mama prabho he madIshvara|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>yIshurakathayat, he thomA mAM nirIkShya vishvasiShi ye na dR^iShTvA vishvasanti taeva dhanyAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>etadanyAni pustake.asmin alikhitAni bahUnyAshcharyyakarmmANi yIshuH shiShyANAM purastAd akarot|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>kintu yIshurIshvarasyAbhiShiktaH suta eveti yathA yUyaM vishvasitha vishvasya cha tasya nAmnA paramAyuH prApnutha tadartham etAni sarvvANyalikhyanta|</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>tataH paraM tibiriyAjaladhestaTe yIshuH punarapi shiShyebhyo darshanaM dattavAn darshanasyAkhyAnamidam|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>shimonpitaraH yamajathomA gAlIlIyakAnnAnagaranivAsI nithanel sivadeH putrAvanyau dvau shiShyau chaiteShvekatra militeShu shimonpitaro.akathayat matsyAn dhartuM yAmi|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>tataste vyAharan tarhi vayamapi tvayA sArddhaM yAmaH tadA te bahirgatAH santaH kShipraM nAvam Arohan kintu tasyAM rajanyAm ekamapi na prApnuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>prabhAte sati yIshustaTe sthitavAn kintu sa yIshuriti shiShyA j nAtuM nAshaknuvan|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>tadA yIshurapR^ichChat, he vatsA sannidhau ki nchit khAdyadravyam Aste? te.avadan kimapi nAsti|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>tadA so.avadat naukAyA dakShiNapArshve jAlaM nikShipata tato lapsyadhve, tasmAt tai rnikShipte jAle matsyA etAvanto.apatan yena te jAlamAkR^iShya nottolayituM shaktAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>tasmAd yIshoH priyatamashiShyaH pitarAyAkathayat eSha prabhu rbhavet, eSha prabhuriti vAchaM shrutvaiva shimon nagnatAheto rmatsyadhAriNa uttarIyavastraM paridhAya hradaM pratyudalamphayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>apare shiShyA matsyaiH sArddhaM jAlam AkarShantaH kShudranaukAM vAhayitvA kUlamAnayan te kUlAd atidUre nAsan dvishatahastebhyo dUra Asan ityanumIyate|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>tIraM prAptaistaistatra prajvalitAgnistadupari matsyAH pUpAshcha dR^iShTAH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>tato yIshurakathayad yAn matsyAn adharata teShAM katipayAn Anayata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>ataH shimonpitaraH parAvR^itya gatvA bR^ihadbhistripa nchAshadadhikashatamatsyaiH paripUrNaM tajjAlam AkR^iShyodatolayat kintvetAvadbhi rmatsyairapi jAlaM nAChidyata|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>anantaraM yIshustAn avAdIt yUyamAgatya bhuMgdhvaM; tadA saeva prabhuriti j nAtatvAt tvaM kaH? iti praShTuM shiShyANAM kasyApi pragalbhatA nAbhavat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>tato yIshurAgatya pUpAn matsyAMshcha gR^ihItvA tebhyaH paryyaveShayat|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>itthaM shmashAnAdutthAnAt paraM yIshuH shiShyebhyastR^itIyavAraM darshanaM dattavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>bhojane samApte sati yIshuH shimonpitaraM pR^iShTavAn, he yUnasaH putra shimon tvaM kim etebhyodhikaM mayi prIyase? tataH sa uditavAn satyaM prabho tvayi prIye.ahaM tad bhavAn jAnAti; tadA yIshurakathayat tarhi mama meShashAvakagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>tataH sa dvitIyavAraM pR^iShTavAn he yUnasaH putra shimon tvaM kiM mayi prIyase? tataH sa uktavAn satyaM prabho tvayi prIye.ahaM tad bhavAn jAnAti; tadA yIshurakathayata tarhi mama meShagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>pashchAt sa tR^itIyavAraM pR^iShTavAn, he yUnasaH putra shimon tvaM kiM mayi prIyase? etadvAkyaM tR^itIyavAraM pR^iShTavAn tasmAt pitaro duHkhito bhUtvA.akathayat he prabho bhavataH kimapyagocharaM nAsti tvayyahaM prIye tad bhavAn jAnAti; tato yIshuravadat tarhi mama meShagaNaM pAlaya|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>ahaM tubhyaM yathArthaM kathayAmi yauvanakAle svayaM baddhakaTi ryatrechChA tatra yAtavAn kintvitaH paraM vR^iddhe vayasi hastaM vistArayiShyasi, anyajanastvAM baddhvA yatra gantuM tavechChA na bhavati tvAM dhR^itvA tatra neShyati|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>phalataH kIdR^ishena maraNena sa Ishvarasya mahimAnaM prakAshayiShyati tad bodhayituM sa iti vAkyaM proktavAn| ityukte sati sa tamavochat mama pashchAd AgachCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>yo jano rAtrikAle yIsho rvakSho.avalambya, he prabho ko bhavantaM parakareShu samarpayiShyatIti vAkyaM pR^iShTavAn, taM yIshoH priyatamashiShyaM pashchAd AgachChantaM</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>pitaro mukhaM parAvarttya vilokya yIshuM pR^iShTavAn, he prabho etasya mAnavasya kIdR^ishI gati rbhaviShyati?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>sa pratyavadat, mama punarAgamanaparyyantaM yadi taM sthApayitum ichChAmi tatra tava kiM? tvaM mama pashchAd AgachCha|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>tasmAt sa shiShyo na mariShyatIti bhrAtR^igaNamadhye kiMvadantI jAtA kintu sa na mariShyatIti vAkyaM yIshu rnAvadat kevalaM mama punarAgamanaparyyantaM yadi taM sthApayitum ichChAmi tatra tava kiM? iti vAkyam uktavAn|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>yo jana etAni sarvvANi likhitavAn atra sAkShya ncha dattavAn saeva sa shiShyaH, tasya sAkShyaM pramANamiti vayaM jAnImaH|</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>yIshuretebhyo.aparANyapi bahUni karmmANi kR^itavAn tAni sarvvANi yadyekaikaM kR^itvA likhyante tarhi granthA etAvanto bhavanti teShAM dhAraNe pR^ithivyAM sthAnaM na bhavati| iti||</para>
</usx>
